<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Acts</book>
  <para style="h">Acts</para>
  <para style="toc1">Acts</para>
  <para style="toc2">Acts</para>
  <para style="mt">Acts</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Theophil, hmâna lehkhaah khân, Isua thiltih leh a zirtîr ṭan tirh zawng zawng thu kha ka ziak a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlarau Thianghlim ṭanpuia a tirhkoh thlante hnêna thu a tiam zawha vâna hruai chhohva a awm tâk ni thlenga thu kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tuar hnuin tirhkohte hnênah fiahna rintlak tam tak hmangin nungin a inlâr a, ni sawmli zet an hnênah a inlâr a, Pathian ram thu a sawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, an awm khâwm a pâwl ve a, “Jerusalem khua kalsan suh u, Pa thil tiam ka sawi in hriat kha lo nghâk rawh u,” a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Johana khân tuiin a baptis ṭhîn a; nimahsela, ni rei lo têan Thlarau Thianghlimin baptisma in chang ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan an rawn inkhâwmin a hnênah, “Lalpa, tûnah em ni Israel-te hnênah ram i pêk leh dâwn?” an ti a, an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Pain a hun leh a ni, ama thû thûa awma a ruat chu, nangni lo hriat tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, Thlarau Thianghlim chu in chunga a lo thlen hunah thiltihtheihna in la nei ang; tichuan, Jerusalem khuaah te, Judai leh Samari ram khaw tinah te, kâwlkil thleng pawhin ka thuhretute in ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu a sawi zawhin an hmuh reng chungin vâna hruai chhohvin a awm a; tin, chhûmin an hmuh phâk lohvah a hruai bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a chhoh laia vân lam an en reng laiin mi pahnih, puan vâr sinin an kiangah an lo ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chu mite chuan, “Galili rama mite u, engati nge vân lam ena in din reng? He Isua, in hnên ata vâna hruai chhohva a awm hi, vâna a chho in hmu ang bawk hian amah ngei hi a lo kal leh ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Olivet tlâng an tih ata chu Jerusalem khuaah an kîr leh ta a; chumi tlâng chu Jerusalem khaw kiang a ni a, Chawlhnia kalna tâwk chauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, an luhin, an awmna pindan chungnungah chuan an chho va, Petera leh Johana nên, Jakoba leh Andria nên, Philipa leh Thoma nên, Bartholomaia leh Matthaia nên, Alphaia fapa Jakoba leh Simona, Zelot pâwla mi leh Jakoba fa Juda nên an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chûngho zawng zawng chu hmeichhia tute emaw leh Isua nu Mari nên, Isua unaute nên, rilru hmun khata ṭhahnemngai taka ṭawngṭaiin an awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chûng ni chuan unaute zîngah Petera a ding a, an za chuan za leh sawmhnih lai an ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Unaute u, Thlarau Thianghlimin Davida kâa, Isua mantute hruaitu Juda thu a sawi lâwk kha, kha Pathian Lehkha Thu kha lo thleng tur rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chu kan zînga chhiar tel a ni a, hêng rawngbâwlnaah hian chan pawh a nei ve si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(Tin, chu mi chuan a sual manin hmun pakhat a lei a, bawkkhupin a tla a, a laiah a puak keh a, a rîl zawng zawng a chhuak vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu Jerusalem khuaa awmte zawng zawngin an lo hria a; chutichuan, chu hmun chu anmahni ṭawngin ‘Akeldama’ an ti a, chu chu ‘Thisen Hmun’ tihna a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Fakna Hla Buah hêng thu hi ziak a ni: ‘A awmna tihramin awm rawh se, A chhûngah tu mah awm suh se,’ tih leh, ‘A hotu nihna chu mi dangin chang rawh se,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Isua, kan zînga lût ṭhîn, chhuak ṭhîna a awm chhûng zawnga, Johana baptisma achin, kan hnên ata vâna hruai chhohva a awm ni thleng khân, hêng min pâwl ṭhînte zîngah hian mi pakhat, a thawhlehna min hriatpuitu atân a awm tur a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, mi pahnih an ruat a, pakhat chu Josefa, Barsaba an tiha chu (a hming dang Justa an ti bawk a); tin, pakhat chu Matthia a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, an ṭawngṭai a, “Nang, Lalpa, mihring zawng zawng rilru hretu, Juda chuan ama awmnaa kal tûrin hêng rawngbâwl leh tirhkoh hna a tlâwmsan hi, a ai awh tûrin he mite pahnih hi, a tu zâwk nge i thlan min hriattîr ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ai an ensak a, an ai en chu Matthia chungah a lo tlu a; tichuan, ani chu tirhkoh sâwm leh pakhatte zîngah chuan chhiar tel a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Pentikos ni a lo thlenin, an zain hmun khatah an awm khâwm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, thâwklehkhatan vân ata ri, thlipui tleh angin a lo thleng ta phut a; tin, chu chuan an ṭhutna in chu a tikhat ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, leite amaha insem darhin, mei angin an hnênah a lo inlâr ta a. Tin, an chungah a chuang ṭheuh va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an zain Thlarau Thianghlimin an khat ta vek a, Thlarauvin a ṭawngtîr ang zêlin ṭawng dangin an lo ṭawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, vân hnuaia hnam tin zîng ata Pathian ngaihsak Juda-te Jerusalem khuaah an châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, chu ri chu an hriat veleh mipui an rawn inkhâwm a, mi tinin an ṭawng chu mahni ṭawng ṭheuhva an lo hriat avângin an rilruin an lo buai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, an za chuan an mangang a, mak an ti hle a, “En teh u, hênga ṭawngte zawng zawng hi Galili rama mi an ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Engtin nge kan zaa kan ṭawng pianpui anga kan hriat ṭheuh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat Parthai hnam te, Medai hnam te, Elamitai hnam te kan ni a; ṭhenkhat Mesopotamia rama awm te, Judai rama awm te, Kappadokia rama awm te, Ponto rama awm te, Asia rama awm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Phrugia rama awm te, Pamphulia rama awm te, Aigupta rama awm te, Kurini khaw kiang vêla Libua rama awm te kan ni a; ṭhenkhat Rom khaw khual- Juda-te leh an saphunte nên- kan ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ṭhenkhat Kret thliarkâra mi leh Arab rama mi kan ni si a; nimahsela, Pathian thiltih ropuite an sawi, mahni ṭawng ṭheuhvin kan hriat si hi!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an za chuan mak an ti hle mai a, a ngaihna an hre lo va, “Hêng hi eng tizia nge ni?” an inti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ṭhenkhatin an nuihsan a. “Uain thar an rui a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, Petera chu sâwm leh pakhatte nên an ding za a, ani chuan aw ring takin an hnênah a sawi a, “Nangni Judai rama mite u, nangni Jerusalem khuaa awm zawng zawngte u, hêng hi hria ula, ka thu pawh ngai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hêngho hi in rin angin an rui lo ve, fehrehsân lai chauh a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hêng hi zâwlnei Joelan a sawi kha a ni zâwk:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Pathianin, Ni hnuhnûngahte chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Mi zawng zawng chungah ka Thlarau ka leih ang a; Tichuan, in fapate, in fanuten ka thu an hril ang a; In tlangvâlten inlârnate an hmu ang a, In putarten mumangah an mang ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni, chûng nîahte chuan ka bâwihpate, ka bâwihnute chungah pawh, Ka Thlarau ka leih ang a, ka thu an hril ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, chung lam vânah thilmak te, Hnuai lam leiah chhinchhiahna te ka hmuhtîr ang a; Thisen te, mei te, meikhu hu te nên:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nî thimah a chang ang a, Thla thisenah a chang ang a, Lalpa ni ropui tak leh hmingthang tak chu A lo thlen hmain;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Tu pawh Lalpa hming lam apiang chu an him ang, a ti e,’ a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangni Israel mite u, hêng thu hi hre rawh u: Nazareth Isua, Pathianin amah hmangin in zîngah thil ropui te, thilmak tak te, chhinchhiahna te a tih khânin a hriat chiantîr che u kha; nangni ngeiin chûng chu in hre si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />kha mi kha Pathian rêl tlat leh hriat lâwk angin an mantîr a, nangnin mi sualte kutin kraws-ah in khêngbet a, in tihlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kha mi kha Pathianin thihna phuarnate chu a phelhsak a, a kai tho ta a; amah chu thihna chelh hlen rual a nih loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a thu a sawi a, ‘Ka hmaah kumkhuain Lalpa chu ka hmu ṭhîn a. Ka mangan loh nân ka ding lamah a awm a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka thinlung a hlim a, Ka lei pawh a lâwm a; Chuvângin, ka tisa pawh beisei takin a awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka thlarau chu mitthi khuaah i hnutchhiah lo vang a, I mi thianghlim ṭawih ral i phal hek lo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangin nunna kawngte mi hriattîr a, Nangin i hmêlin lâwmin mi tikhat ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Unaute u, chi thlahtu Davida thu hi hlau lovin in hnênah ka sawi thei e; ani zawng a thi a, phûm pawh an phûm tawh alâwm, a thlân pawh tûn thlengin kan hnênah a la awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ani chu zâwlnei a ni a, Pathianin a ṭhâlbea mi, tu emaw a ṭhutphah chungah a ṭhuttîr dâwn tih chhechhamin a sawi tih a hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tichuan, chûng chu a lo hriat lâwk reng avângin, Krista thawhleh tûr thu a sawi a ni, ‘Mitthi khuaa hnutchhiahin a awm hek lo, a ruang pawh a ṭawih hek lo,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chu Isua chu Pathianin a kai tho leh ta rêng a ni, chu chu a hretu kan zain kan ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian kut ding lamah chawimawiin a awm a, Thlarau Thianghlim tiam chu Pa hnên ata a hmu a, in hmuh leh in hriat hi a han leih a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Davida zawng vânah a lâwn chho lo a ni, amah ngeiin, ‘Jehovan ka Lalpa hnênah, Ka ding lamah ṭhu reng rawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />I hmêlmate i kephah nghahchhana ka siam hma loh zawng, a ti e,’ a ti zâwk a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isua in khenbeha ngei kha, Pathianin Lal leh Krista ni fâwmin a siam ta tih, Israel hnam tinin hre mawlh rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu an hriatin an thinlunga chhun ang an lo ni ta a, Petera leh tirhkoh dangte hnênah chuan, “Unaute u, engtin nge kan tih tâk ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Petera chuan an hnênah, “Sim ula, in sual ngaihdam nân Isua Krista hmingin baptisma chang ṭheuh rawh u; tichuan, Thlarau Thianghlim pêk hi in hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A tiam kha nangni tân pawh, in fate tân pawh, hla taka mi zawng zawng tân pawh, Lalpa kan Pathianin a hnêna a koh apiangte tân a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, thu dang tam takin a hrilhfiah a; “Tûnlai ṭhangthar bengtla lote lakah hian intihim rawh u,” tiin a fuih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, a thu zâwm apiangin baptisma an chang ta a; chumi nîah chuan mi sângthum laia belhchhahin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, tirhkohte zirtîrin, inpâwlin, chhang phelin, ṭawngṭaiin ṭhahnemngai takin an awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, mi tinin an hlau ta a; tirhkohte chuan thilmak leh chhinchhiahna tam tak an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, a ring apiang chuan engkim an inṭâwm hlawm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />an rote, an sumte an hralh a, an châkkhai daih lek ṭheuhvin an zaa hnênah chuan an sem ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, ni tin rilru hmun khatin Pathian biak inah chuan ṭhahnemngai takin an awm ṭhîn a, an in lamahte pawh chhang an phel a, hlim tak leh lungawi takin an chaw an ei ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pathian an fak a, mi zawng zawng lawm zâwngin an awm ṭhîn. Tin, a chhandam mêk apiangte chu Lalpan ni tin an hnênah a teltîr zêl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Petera leh Johana chu behliang mun hunin, ṭawngṭai hun lai chuan, Pathian biak ina lût tûrin an chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, patling tu emaw a pian tirh ata kebai an rawn zâwn a, chu mi chu biak ina lûtte hnêna kut dawh tûrin biak in kawngkhâr, ‘Mawi’ an tih bulah chuan ni tin an muttîr ṭhîn a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chu mi chuan Petera leh Johana Pathian biak ina lût tûr chu a hmu a, kut a dawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Peteran ani chu a en reng a, Johana pawhin; tin, Peteran, “Min han en rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an lakah eng emaw hmuh a beisei a, a han en a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, Peteran, “Tangka leh rangkachak eng mah ka nei lo; nimahsela, ka neih chhun ka pe ang che: Nazareth Isua Krista hmingin kein kal tawh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a kut ding lam a chelh a, a kai tho ta a; tin, thâwklehkhatan a kete leh a kheimit ruhte chu a lo chak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a zuang tho va, a ding a, kein a kal ṭan ta a. Tin, kea kal kal leh, zuang zuang leh, Pathian fak chung zêlin biak inah chuan a lût ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, kea a kal leh Pathian a fak chu mi zawng zawngin an hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />biak in kawngkhâr ‘Mawi’ bula kutdawha ṭhu ṭhîn kha a ni tih an hria a; a chunga thil thleng chu mak an ti êm êm a, an buai hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Petera leh Johana chu a chelh reng laiin, mi zawng zawngin mak an ti êm êm a, hulhliap, Solomona ta an tihah chuan an hnênah an lo tlân khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Peteran chu chu a hmuhin, mite chu a bia a, “Nangni Israel mite u, hêng hi engati nge mak in tih? Keimahni thiltihtheihna leh Pathian kan ngaihsak avânga ani hi kan kaltîr ang êm chuan engati nge min en reng?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te Pathian, min thlahtute Pathian chuan a Chhiahhlawh Isua a chawimawi ta a nih hi; ani chu in mantîr a, Pilatan chhuah a tum pawhin a hmaah in lo duh loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi Thianghlim leh Fel tak kha in duh lo va, tualthattu kha in hnêna pêk in ngên ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nunna Siamtu chu in that a; nimahsela, Pathianin ani chu mitthi zîng ata a kai tho leh a; chu chu a hretute kan ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ama hming rin avângin, a hming chuan he mi in hmuh leh in hriat ṭhin hi a tichak ta a ni; a ni, amah avânga rinna lo awm hian in zaa mit hmuhah a tidam ta viah a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, unaute u, in hotute pawhin an ât avânga an tih ang khân, in ât avângin hêng hi in ti a ni tih ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathianin zâwlnei zawng zawng kaan, a Krista chuan hrehawm a tuar tûr thu a hriattîr lâwk kha, khati khân a thlentîr ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, in sualte thai bo a nih theih nân sim ula, hawi kîr leh rawh u; chutichuan, Lalpa hnên ata harh hunte a lo la thleng thei ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Krista Isua, in tâna a ruat pawh kha, a rawn tîr thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, engkim siam ṭhat hun a thlen hma loh zawng vânin ani chu a kawl rih tûr a ni; chumi siam ṭhat tûr thu chu Pathianin leilung pian tirh ata a zâwlnei thianghlim awmte kain a sawi tawh kha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosia ngeiin, ‘Lal Pathianin keimah mi siam ang hian in unaute zîngan zâwlnei pakhat a siamsak ang che u; ani chuan thu zawng zawng in hnêna a sawi apiang chu in ngaihthlâksak ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tin, mi tu pawh, chu zâwlnei thu chu ngaihthlâksak lo apiang mi zîng ata tihboral daih an ni ang,’ a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ni, Samuela awm achin zâwlnei zawng zawng, an hnunga mite nên, thu sawi apiang khân, tûnlai chanchin hi an hril lâwk bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nangni hi zâwlneite leh thuthlung fate in ni asin; Pathianin Abrahama hnênah, ‘I thlah avângin khawvêla hnam tin an thawveng ang,’ tiin, in thlahtute hnênah a tiam kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathianin a Chhiahhlawh chu a ruat a, in sualte hawisantîr ṭheuhvin malsâwmsak tûr che uin, nangmahni hnênah a rawn tîr hmasa ber a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Petera leh Johanan mite hnêna thu an sawi lai chuan puithiamho te, biak in hotu te leh Saddukaiho te chu an hnênah an lo thleng phut a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />mi an zirtîr leh Isua avânga mitthi zîng ata thawhleh thu an hrilh avângin an lungni lo êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, an man a, tlai lam a nih avângin a tûk thlengin tân inah an khung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, thu ngaithlahote zînga tam takin an âwih a; an tam lam chu patling hlîr pawh sângnga lai an tling a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan an hotu te, upa te, lehkhaziaktu te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puithiam lalber Ana te, Kaiapha te, Johana te, Aleksandra te, puithiam lalber chi zawng zawngte pawh, Jerusalem khuaah an awm khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Petera leh Johana chu a laiah an dintîr a, “Eng tih theihnain nge, tu hmingin nge hêng hi in tih?” an ti a, an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Petera chu Thlarau Thianghlimin a khat a, an hnênah, “Mi zawng zawng hotute u, upate u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />mi chak lo tihṭhat thûah, ‘He mi hi eng vângin nge a lo dam tâk?’ tiin vawiinah hian min chhuahchhalh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nangni zawng zawngin hre rawh u, Israel mi zawng zawng pawhin hre rawh se: Nazareth Isua Krista, kraws-a in khenbeh, Pathianin mitthi zîng ata a kaihthawh leh kha, ama hming ngeiin he mi hi hetah in hmaah damin a ding ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangni in satute u, in lung paih, a kila lung ṭangkai ber lo ni ta kha amah hi a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi dang tu ma hnênah chhandamna a awm lo; vân hnuaia mihring sak zîngan, min chhandam tûr hming dang rêng a awm lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Petera leh Johana huaizia chu an hmuhin, lehkhathiamlo leh mi mâwl mai an ni tih an hriatin mak an ti hle a; Isua hnênah an awm tawh tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, mi an tihdama chu an hnêna ding an hmu a, eng mah an sawisêl thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, an rorêlna ata an kal hrantîr hnuin an inrâwn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hêng mite hi engtin nge kan tih ang? Thil mak thang tak an ti tih Jerusalem khuaa awm zawng zawngin fiah takin an hriat tâk hi; keini pawhin kan hnial thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, mi hnêna a puan lehzual theih loh nân, tûn achinah tu hnênah mah he hminga thu an sawi lohna tûrin i vau ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, anni chu an ko va, Isua hminga thusawi tawp loh tûr leh zirtîr tawp loh tûr an ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Petera leh Johanan an hnênah, “Pathian mit hmuhin Pathian thu zawm aiin nangni thu zawm a dik zâwk emaw chu, ngaihtuah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keini zawng thil kan hmuh leh kan hriatte kha sawi lovin kan awm thei lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan an vau lehzual a, an chhuah ta a, mipui avângin hremna remchâng an hmu lo; an thiltih avâng khân mi zawng zawngin Pathian an chawimawi si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thil maka an tihdama chu kum sawmli aia tam zâwk mah a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Petera leh Johana chu an chhuahin, anmahni pâwlte hnênah an va kal a, puithiam lalte leh upaten an hnêna an sawi apiang chu an hrilh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, a ngaithlatute chuan a rualin aw ring takin Pathian hnênah, “Lalpa, nang vân te, lei te, tuifinriat te, a chhûnga awmte zawng zawng Siamtu i ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />nangin Thlarau Thianghlimin, min thlahtu i chhiahhlawh Davida kain hêng thu hi i sawi a ni: ‘Jentail-te engati nge an thinur kha? Hnam tinin engati nge thil sâwt lo an ngaihtuah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khawvêl lalten an ep huai huai a, Hotute pawh an pung khâwm a, Lalpa leh a Krista chungah chuan,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He khuaah hian i Chhiahhlawh thianghlim, i hriak thih Isua chungah khân, Heroda leh Pontia Pilata nên, Jentail-te leh Israel mite nên an pung khâwm tak zet a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />i kut leh i rilruin lo thleng tûra a ruat lâwk apiang kha ti tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, tûnah Lalpa, an mi vauziate hi ngai teh; i bâwihte hi huai takin i thu hriltîr la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />mite tidam tûrin nangin i kut phar ang che; i Chhiahhlawh Thianghlim Isua hming avângin, chhinchhiahna leh thilmak takte tihtîr bawk ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, an ṭawngṭai zawhin an awm khâwmna chu a lo nghîng a, an zain Thlarau Thianghlimin an lo khat a, huai takin Pathian thu an hril ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, a ringtu mipuite chu rilru hmun khat leh ngaihtuah hmun khatin an awm a: an zînga pakhat mahin an sum neih, “Ka ta bîk a ni,” an ti lo; thil zawng zawng an inṭâwm zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, tirhkohte chuan awihawm takin Lal Isua thawhleh thu an hriattîr ṭhîn a; an zaa chungah khawngaihna nasa tak a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, an zîngah pawh tlachham tu mah an awm lo; ramte, inte nei apiangin an hralh a, an thil hralhte chu a man an rawn keng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tirhkohte ke bulah an dah ṭhîn a; an châkkhai daih tâwk ṭheuhvin an sem ṭheuh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Josefa, tirhkohten Barnaba an tiha chu (chu mi hming awmzia chu, “Thlamuanna Fa” tihna a ni a), Levia chi, Kupra thliarkâra mi a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />a lo neih chu hralhin a man a rawn keng a, tirhkohte ke bulah a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nimahsela, mi pakhat a hming Anania, a nupui Saphiri nên an awm a; Anania chuan ram a hralh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a nupui hriatin a man a ṭhen a zêp ta a; tin, a ṭhen a rawn keng a, tirhkohte ke bulah chuan a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, Peteran, “Anani, Thlarau Thianghlim bum tûr leh, ram man a ṭhen zêp tûrin engati nge Setanan i thinlung a tihkhah le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A awm chhûng zawng khân i ta a ni reng lo vem ni? I hralh hnu pawh khân i thû thûin a awm lo vem ni? Engati nge hêng thu hi i rilrua i ngaihtuah? Mihring bum i ni lo ve, Pathian bum i ni zâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Anania chuan chûng thu chu a hriat veleh a tlu a, a thi ta a; tin, a hria apiangin an hlau ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, tlangvâlhote chu an tho va, an tuam a, an zâwn chhuak a, an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, dârkâr thum lai emaw chinah chuan a nupui chu, thil awmzia chu hre lovin a lo lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Peteran a hnênah, “Mi hrilh rawh, ram chu heti zât chauhvin maw in hralh?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Aw, heti zât chauh hian a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Peteran a hnênah, “Engati nge Lalpa Thlarau fiah nân in inthurual ni? Ngai teh, i pasal phûmtute kephah chu kawngka bulah a lo awm ta, nang pawh an zâwn chhuak ang che!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, thâwklehkhatan a ke bulah chuan a tlu ta nghâl a, a thi ve ta a; tin, tlangvâlhote chu an lo lût a, ani chu thiin an rawn hmu a, an zâwn chhuak a, a pasal kiangah chuan an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kohhranhote zawng zawng leh chûng thu hria apiangte chuan an hlau ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, mi zîngah Pathianin tirhkohte kutin chhinchhiahna leh thilmak tam tak a ti ṭhîn. Tin, anniho chu an zain rilru hmun khatin Solomona Hulhliapah chuan an inkhâwm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi dang erawh chu tu mah an zîngah an tel ve ngam ta lo va; nimahsela, miin anniho chu an fak si ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a ring tharho hmeichhia leh mipa tam takin Lalpa hnênah chuan an rawn belhchhah lehzual ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />chutichuan, damlote pawh kawtthlêrahte an zâwn chhuak a, khumahte, âwngphahahte an muttîr a, Petera kal pahin a hlim talin a ṭhen a zâr a hliah theih nân an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khaw kiang vêl khua ata mipuite pawh chu dam lote, ramhuai bawlhhlawh sawisakte rawn hruaiin an lo kal khâwm a; chûngte pawh chu an lo dam ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalber leh a ṭhiante zawng zawng an lo thawk a (chûng a ṭhiante chu Saddukai pâwl an ni a), an îtsîk êm êm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tirhkohte chu an man a, vântlang tân inah an khung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, zânah Lalpa vântirhkoh pakhatin kawngkhârte chu a rawn hawng a, a hruai chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Pathian biak inah va ding ula, mi hnênah hêng Nunna thu zawng zawng hi va sawi rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chu thu chu an hriatin, khawvâr hun lai vêlin, Pathian biak inah chuan an va lût a, an zirtîr ta a. Nimahsela, puithiam lalber leh a ṭhiante chu an lo kal a, rorêltuho leh Israel thlahte upaho zawng zawng an ko khâwm a, tirhkohte chu rawn hruaitîr tûrin tân inah chuan mi an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, tiangkengtute chu an va kal a, tân inah chuan anni chu an hmu si lo; tichuan, an kîr leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tân in chu him taka inkhârin, a vêngtute pawh kawngkhâr bulah dingin kan hmu si a; nimahsela, kan han hawng a, a chhûngah tu mah kan hmu si lo!” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Pathian biak in hotu leh puithiam lalten chûng thu chu an hriatin, “Hêng hi eng ti takin puang ang maw?” tiin, an thûah chuan an mangang ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat a lo kal a, an hnênah, “Ngai teh u, tân ina mi in khungte khân Pathian biak inah dingin mi an zirtîr ka ti!” tiin a rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, hotu chu tiangkengtute nên chuan an va kal a, vântlâng an hlauh avângin tlang takin an rawn hruai a; chuti lo chuan, lunga den an hlau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, an rawn hruai thlen chuan rorêltuho hmaah chuan an dintîr a. Tin, puithiam lalber chuan an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“He hming hian zirtîr loh tûr kan tih tlat tawh che u kha; hre rawh u, in thu zirtîrin Jerusalem khua in tihkhah vek tawh hi, chu mi tihhlum bul chu tumtîr min tum a nih hi le,” tiin a chhâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nimahsela, Petera leh tirhkohte chuan, “Mihring thu aiin Pathian thu kan zâwm zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangnin Isua thingah khai kângin in tihhlum kha, min thlahtute Pathianin a kai tho leh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amah ngei kha Pathianin Lalah leh Chhandamtua awm atân a ding lamah a chawimawi ta a, Israel-te sual simtîr tûr leh ngaidam tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chûng thu chu a hretute kan nih hi; Thlarau Thianghlim, Pathianin a thu zâwm apiangte hnêna a pêk kha, hretu a ni ve bawk a,” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan chûng thu chu an hriatin an thin a khei ta êm êm a, tihhlum an tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nimahsela, rorêltute zîngah chuan a hming Gamaliela, Pharisai, Dân hretu, mi zawng zawng zînga hmingthang tak mi pakhat chu a ding a, chu mite chu chhuahtîr rih tûr thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, rorêltute hnênah chuan, “Nangni Israel mite u, he mite chunga in thiltih tum hi fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tûn hma pawh khân, Theoda, ‘Mi lian ka ni,’ tiin a lo awm a; chu mi hnênah chuan mi tam tak, zali lai an lo pakai a; ani chu tihhlumin a awm ta a; a thu zâwm apiang an zain an darh ta vek a, eng mah an ni tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chu mi awm hnuah chuan hming ziak lai khân, Galili rama mi Juda kha a lo awm leh a; a hnênah mi ṭhenkhat a hîp leh a; nimahsela, ani pawh chu a thi ta a, a thu zâwm apiangte chu an zain an darh ta vek mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah ka ti a che u, hêng mite hi tawk suh ula, awm mai rawh se; hêng an thiltih tum leh an thiltih hi, mihring tihchhuah mai a nih chuan a boral ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />amaherawhchu, Pathian tihchhuah a nih chuan anmahni in tiboral thei lo vang; chuti lo chuan, Pathian do in lo ni hlauh dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, a sawi chu rem an ti ta a; tichuan, tirhkohte chu an ko va, an vêl a; an velh zawhin, Isua hminga thu sawi loh tûr ti tlatin an thlah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chutichuan, rorêltute zîng ata an kal chhuak a, chu Hming avânga mualpho tuar tlâka ruat an nih avângin an lâwm hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, ni tin Pathian biak inah leh anmahni inahte, “Isua chu Krista a ni,” tiin, zirtîr leh hril an bâng chuang lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chûng laia zirtîrho an pun an pun lai chuan, an ni tin thil semah anmahni hmeithaite an ngaihsak ṭhin loh avângin Grik Juda-te chu Hebraite chungah an lo phunnawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, sâwm leh pahnihte chuan zirtîr mipuite chu an ko va, “Pathian thu hril bânsanin, dawhkânahte rawng kan bâwl chuan a ṭha lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, unaute u, in zîngah Thlarau leh fina khat, mi hmingṭha hlîr pasarih thlang rawh u, anni chu hêng thil rêltu atân hian kan siam ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />keini erawh chu ṭawngṭai leh thu rawngbâwlin kan awm leh tlat zêl ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng thu chuan mipui zawng zawng chu a tilâwm a; tichuan, Stephana, rinna leh Thlarau Thianghlima khat nên, Philipa nên, Prokora nên, Nikanora nên, Timona nên, Parmena nên, Nikola, Juda-te saphun Antiokei khuaa mi nên an thlang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chûng mite chu tirhkohte hmaah an dintîr a; tin, anni chuan an ṭawngṭai a, an chungah an kut an nghat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Pathian thu chu a lo darh a; Jerusalem khuaah chuan zirtîrteho an pung nasa ta êm êm a; puithiamte zîngah pawh mi tam takin chu rinna chu an âwih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Stephana chu ngilneihna leh thiltihtheihnain a khat a, mi zîngah thilmak leh chhinchhiahna ropui tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, Sal Chhuakho te, Kurini khuaa mi te, Aleksandria khuaa mi te inkhâwmna an tiha mi, mi ṭhenkhat leh Kilikia rama mi te, Asia rama mi te inkhâwmnaa mi, mi ṭhenkhat chu an lo thawk a, Stephana chu an rawn hnial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, a finna leh a sawipuitu Thlarau chu an let thla thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, mite an tham a, chûng mite chuan, “Mosia leh Pathian a sawi chhiat kan hria,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, mite, upate, lehkhaziaktute an fuihpawrh a, Stephana chu an bei a, an man a, rorêltute hnênah an hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, hretu derte an siam a, chûng mite chuan, “He mi hian he in Thianghlim leh Dân hi a sawi chhe fo ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />he Nazareth Isua hian he in hi a ṭhiat ang a, Mosia Dân min pêkte kha a tidanglam dâwn tih a sawi kan hria,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, rorêltuho ṭhute zawng zawng chuan Stephana chu an en reng a, a hmêl chu vântirhkoh hmêl angin an hmu a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalber chuan, “Hêng thu hi a dik em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Stephana chuan, “Unaute u, pate u, ngai teh u, min thlahtu Abrahama, Haran khuaa a awm hmaa Mesopotamia rama a awm lai khân, Ropuina Pathian chu a hnênah a rawn inlâr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a hnênah, ‘I khaw lam leh i chiteho zîng ata chhuak la, ram ka la entîr tûr che lamah kal rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ani chu Kaldai-ho ram ata a kal chhuak a, Haran khuaah a va awm ta a; tin, a pa a thih hnuin, chuta ṭangin hei, tûna in awmna khaw lamah hian Pathianin a pêm luhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, hetah hi chuan eng mah hmun luah tûr, a ke nghahna tham pawh a pe lo va; nimahsela, amah leh a hnua a thlahte thlenga ro tûrin pêk a tiam a, fa a la neih hma pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin hetiang hian a sawi: ‘A thlahte mi ram lamah kum zali an thang ang a, miin bâwihah an siam ang a, an tiduhdah bawk ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin, ‘A bâwihtu tûrte hnam chu keimahin ka la ngaihtuah ang a; tin, chumi zawhah chuan an lo chhuak ang a, hemi hmunah hian ka rawng an la bâwl ang,’ a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin a hnênah serhtan thu kha a thlung a; chutichuan, Abrahama chuan Isaaka a hring a, a ni riat nîah a serh a tan a; tin, Isaaka chuan Jakoba a hring a; tin, Jakoba chuan chi thlahtu sâwm leh pahnihte kha a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chi thlahtute khân Josefa an îtsîk a, Aigupta ram lamah an hralh a; nimahsela, Pathian a hnênah a awm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a hrehawm tuar zawng zawngah a chhan chhuak zêl a, Aigupta ram lal Pharaoa pawh a khawngaihtîr a, mi fing tak a ni tih a hriattîr bawk a; tichuan, ani chuan Aigupta ram leh a ina mi zawng zawng chungah hotuah a siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta leh Kanaan ram zawng zawngah chuan ṭâm a lo tla a, hrehawm nasa tak a lo thleng ta a; min thlahtute chuan ei tûr rêng rêng an hmu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, Jakoba chuan Aigupta ramah buh a awm tih a hriat veleh, min thlahtute chu a tîr chhuak a; chu chu an kal ṭan tirhna ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, an kal vawi hnihnaah chuan Josefa chu a unaute hnênah chuan a inhriattîr a; tin, Josefa unaute chu Pharaoa an hriattîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Josefa chuan a pa Jakoba leh a unau zawng zawng a kohtîr a; anmahni chu sawmsarih leh panga an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Jakoba chu Aigupta ramah a zuk kal a; tin, ani leh min thlahtute chu an thi ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sekem khua an zâwn thleng a, Abrahaman Sekem khuaa Hamora fapate laka thlân, tangkaruaa a leiah khân an zalh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin Abrahama hnêna thu a tiam kha a hun chu a lo thlen dâwnin, mite chu Aigupta ramah chuan an lo pung a, an lo tam ta deuh deuh va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Josefa hre lo lal dang a lo awm thleng khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu mi chuan kan chite a ngamthlêm a, min thlahtute chu a tiduhdah a, an nausênte nung lo tûrin a paih chhuahtîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Mosia a lo piang a, a hmêl a ṭha êm êm mai a; a pa inah thla thum an châwm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tin, an paih chhuahin Pharaoa fanuin a la a, ama fa atân a châwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chu Aigupta rama mite finna zawng zawng an zirtîr a, a thûah leh a thiltihah a ropui êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan kum sawmli a lo tlin chuan a unau, Israela thlahte chu kan a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, an zînga mi pakhat tihretheih tuar lai a hmu a, a chhan a, tihduhdah tuartu phuba chu a la a, Aigupta mi chu a tihlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosia chuan ama kutin Pathianin anmahni a chhanhim tih a unauten an hria emaw a ti a; nimahsela, an hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah an zînga mi pahnih an insual laiin an hnênah a lo thleng a, ‘Pute u, unau in ni alâwm; engati nge dik lo taka in intih?’ tiin rem a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, a ṭhenawm chunga kawhmawh bâwltu zâwk chuan Mosia chu a nam kiang a, ‘Kan chungah hotuah leh rorêltuah tuin nge siam che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nimina Aigupta mi i tihhlum ang khân mi tihhlum i tum a ni maw?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, chumi thu avâng chuan Mosia chu a tlân bo va. Midian ramah a thang reng a, chutah chuan fapa pahnih a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, kum sawmli a vei hnuin Sinai tlâng thlalêrah, hnim bukah, mei alh zîngah vântirhkoh pakhat a hnênah a lo inlâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Mosian a hmuh chuan a thil hmuh chu mak a ti êm a; tin, en tûra a va hnaih laiin Lalpa awin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />‘Kei, i thlahtute Pathian ka nih hi, Abrahama Pathian, Isaaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian chu,’ a lo ti a. Tichuan, Mosia chu a khûr a, a en ngam ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, ‘I kephah ata i pheikhawk kha phelh rawh; i dinna hmun kha lei thianghlim a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aigupta rama ka mi awmte chu an hrehawmzia ka hmu reng asin, an rûm pawh ka hre reng a, anmahni chhanhim tûrin ka lo chhuk ta a ni. Hawh teh, Aigupta ramah ka tîr ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chu Mosia, ‘Hotu leh rorêltuah tuin nge siam che?’ tia an hnar chu, hnim buka vântirhkoh a hnêna inlâr khân a pui a, Pathianin amah ngei chu hotu leh chhanhimtu ni fâwm tûrin a tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ani chuan Aigupta ramah te, Tuifinriat Senah te, thlalêrah te chuan kum sawmli chhûngin thilmak leh chhinchhiahnate a hmuhtîr zêl a, anmahni a hruai chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Israela thlahte hnêna, ‘Pathianin keimah mi siam ang hian, in unaute zînga mi zâwlnei pakhat a siamsak ang che u,’ titu kha a ni, chu Mosia chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chu mi chu thlalêra mipui pung khâwm zînga Sinai tlânga a betu vântirhkoh hnênah leh min thlahtute hnêna awm kha a ni; chu mi chu min pêk chhâwn tûra thu nungte latu kha a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />min thlahtute chuan a thu an zâwm duh lo va, an hnar a, Arona hnênah, ‘Kan hma hruai tûrin pathiante min siamsak rawh; he Mosia, Aigupta ram ata min hruai chhuaktu lah hi a chanchin kan hre ta si lo va,’ tiin an rilrute chu Aigupta ram lamah a lêt leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, chûng lai chuan sebâwngno lem an siam a, a lem chu ran talhin an bia a, anmahni kutchhuak chungah chuan an hlim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathianin a hawisan a, vâna arsiho chibai an bûk theihna tûrin anmahni a ensan ta a; zâwlnei lehkhabua, ‘Israel chite u, thlalêrah khân kum sawmli chhûngin, Sa talh leh ran talhin kei mi bia em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Moloka puan in leh pathian Rephana arsi pawh chu, Chibai bûk tûrin a lem in siamte kha, In zâwn zâwk ṭhîn a; Chuvângin, Babulon khaw piah lamah Ka hruai bo vang che u,’ tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A lem a hmuh anga siam tûra Mosia hrilhtuin a ruat ang khân, min thlahtuten thlalêrah khân hriattîrna puan in chu an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chu bawk chu min thlahtute thlah leh pawhin an nei chhâwng zêl a, Pathianin min thlahtute hmaa Jentail a hnawh chhuahteho ram an luah lai khân, Josua luh rualin an luhpui a; Davida lo awm thleng khân chutah chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Chu Davida chu Pathian mit hmuhin duhsak tlâkin a awm a, Jakoba Pathian tân awmna siamsak a dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nimahsela, Solomonan in chu a saksak ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nimahsela, Chungnungbera chu kuta sak inahte a awm ngai lo; zâwlnei chuan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />‘Lalpan, Vân ka ṭhutphah a ni a, Lei ka kephah nghahchhan a ni: In eng angin nge mi saksak ang? Ka chawlhna hmun pawh eng nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Keima kutin hêng thil engkim hi ka siam lo vem ni? a ti e,’ tia a sawi ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Mi tihmawh, thinlung leh beng tan lohte u, kumkhuain Thlarau Thianghlim in dodâl fo ve; in thlahtute tih ang zêl khân in ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />In thlahtuten zâwlneite zîngah tu nge an tihduhdah loh ni? Mi Fel tak lo kal tûr thu hril lâwktute kha an tihlum a; chu Mi Takzet chu mantîrtu leh thattute nangmahni hi tûnah in ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Dân, vântirhkohte pêk chhâwn kha, hmu zeta zâwm si lote u!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu an hriatin an thin a khei ta a, Stephana chungah chuan an ha an ṭhial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chu Thlarau Thianghlima khat a ni a, vân lam a en tlat a, Pathian ropuizia leh Pathian ding lama Isua ding a hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, vân inhawng ka hmu a, Pathian ding lama Mihring Fapa ding pawh ka hmu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Chutichuan, anni chu aw ring takin an au va, an beng an hup a, rual takin an bei chiam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />khua ata chu an hnawt chhuak a, lungin an dêng a, a hretute chuan tlangvâl pakhat, a hming Saula ke bulah chuan an puante an dah hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Chutichuan, Stephanan, “Lal Isu, ka thlarau la ang che,” tia Lalpa a koh laiin lungin an dêng ruih ruih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhingṭhi a, aw ring takin a au va, “Lalpa, hei an thil tihsual hi an chungah mawh phurhtîr suh ang che,” a ti a. Tin, chu thu chu a sawi zawh veleh a muhîl ta a. Saula pawh chuan a thih chu a remti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni aṭang chuan Jerusalem khuaa kohhran awmte chu nasa takin an tiduhdah ṭan ta a; tichuan, tirhkohte chauh lo chu Judai leh Samari ram khaw tinah an darh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Pathian ngaihsak tuten emaw Stephana chu an phûm a, nasa takin an ṭah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saula erawh chuan kohhranhote a tiduhdah êm êm a, in tinah a lût a, a hmei a pain a hnûk chhuak a, tân inah a khung ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a darhte chu khaw tinah an kal a, thu chu an hril zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Philipa chu Samari khuaah a zuk kal a, an hnênah Krista thu a tlângaupui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ramhuai bawlhhlawhte chu, mi tam tak an manate kawchhûng ata aw ring taka auva an chhuah avâng leh, zeng leh kebai tam takte pawh an lo dam tâk avângin, mipuiten a thu an hriata a thilmak tihte an hmuhin, Philipa thusawi chu rilru hmun khatin an ngaihsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, chumi khuaah chuan nasa takin an lâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a hming Simona, mi pakhat a awm a; ani chuan, “Mi lian ka ni,” tiin, hmânah chumi khuaah chuan dawi hmangin, Samari khuaa mite mak ti takin a siam ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mi zawng zawng chuan, mi chhe ber aṭangin lal ber thlengin, “He mi hi Pathian thiltihtheihna, ‘Ropui’ an tih kha a nih hi,” tiin, a thu an ngaihsak hlawm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A dawi hmangin rei tak mak ti taka a siam ṭhin avângin a thu an ngaihsak ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni chuan Pathian ram Chanchin Ṭha leh Isua Krista hminga Chanchin Ṭha Philipa hril chu an âwih veleh a hmei a pain baptisma an chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Simona meuh pawhin a âwih ve ta a; tin, baptisma a chan zawhin Philipa hnênah a awm reng a, chhinchhiahna leh thilmak nasa tak tihte a hmu a, mak a ti hle mai ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khuaa tirhkoh awmte khân, Samari khuaa miten Pathian thu an âwih tih an hriatin, an hnênah Petera leh Johana chu an tîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />chu mite chu an zuk thlen chuan Thlarau Thianghlim an hmuh theih nân an ṭawngṭaisak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi hma chuan an zîngah tu ma chungah a la thleng lo; Lal Isua hmingin baptisma an chang chauh a la ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, tirhkohte chuan an chungah an kut an nghat a, Thlarau Thianghlim an chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, tirhkohte kut nghah avânga Thlarau Thianghlim pêk a ni tih Simonan a hmuhin, “Hetiang thuneihna hi mi pe ve rawh u, tu chungah pawh kut ka nghahna apiangin Thlarau Thianghlim an hmuh ve nân,” tiin an hnênah tangka pêk a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, Peteran a hnênah, “I tangka hi i boral rualin boral ve rawh se, Pathian thilpêk tangka suma lei i tum avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hêng thûah hian i tel ve lo ve, chan pawh i nei hek lo; i rilru Pathian ngaihin a fel lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvângin, i sual hi sim la, Lalpa hnênah ṭawngṭai rawh; chutichuan, i rilrua i ngaihtuah hi a ngaidam mahna che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Awhna sual nasa tak phuarin i awm tih ka hria e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Simonan, “In thil sawi hi eng mah ka chunga a thlen loh nân, nangnin Lalpa hnênah mi ṭawngṭaisak rawh u,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, anni chuan Lalpa thu chu an hriattîra an sawi zawhin, Jerusalem khuaah an haw leh a; Samari rama mite khaw tam tak hnênah Chanchin Ṭha chu an hril zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh pakhatin Philipa chu a bia a, “Tho la, chhim lama Jerusalem khua aṭanga Gaza khaw zuk chhun kawngah khân kal rawh; chumi kawng chu thlalêrah a kal tlang a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, a tho va, a kal ta a. Tin, ngai teh, Ethiopia rama mi pakhat, Ethiopia lalnu Kandaki hnuaia mi tilreh, lal tak, a ro zawng zawng enkawltu, Jerusalem khuaah Pathian be tûrin a han kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a haw lam chuan a tawlailîra ṭhu chungin zâwlnei Isaia lehkhabu a chhiar zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Thlarau chuan Philipa hnênah, “Saw tawlailîr saw va hnaih la, va pâwl rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Philipa chu mi tilreh hnênah chuan a va tlân a, zâwlnei Isaia lehkhabu a chhiar tih a hria a, “I chhiar kha a awmzia i hria em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Tu ma mi hrilhfiah lohvin engtin nge ka hriat theih ang?” a ti a. Tin, a hnêna ṭhu chhuak tûrin Philipa chu a sâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Pathian Lehkha a chhiar lai chu hei hi a ni: “Talh tûrin berâm angin ani chu an hruai a; Berâmno a hmul mêttu hmaa a ngawi reng angin, Ani pawhin a kâ a âng lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A tlâwm laiin a chungah thu rêl an phal lo; A thlahte chanchin tuin nge la hril ang? Khawvêl aṭangin a nun an lâksak si a,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, mi tilreh chuan Philipa chu a bia a, a hnênah, “Zâwlneiin hêng thu hi tu thu nge a sawi, ama thu nge mi dang thu? Ka zâwt a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Philipa chuan a sawi a, chu Pathian Lehkha thu chu a bulah a ṭan a, a hnênah Isua thu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, kalkawnga an kal laiin tui awmna an thleng a; tin, mi tilreh chuan, “En teh, heta hi tui a awm, baptisma channa tûr engin nge mi dâl kher?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, tawlailîr chu a dintîr a, an pahnihin, Philipa leh mi tilreh chu tuiah chuan an zuk kal dûn a; tin, Philipa chuan ani chu a baptis ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, tui ata an chhuah chhoh veleh, Lalpa Thlarau chuan Philipa chu a la bo ta a; tin, mi tilreh chuan ani chu a hmu leh ta lo, hlim taka a kal tâk zêl avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nimahsela, Philipa chu miin Azota khuaah an hmu leh ta a; tin, a kal tlang a, Kaisari khaw thlengin khaw tinah Chanchin Ṭha chu a hril zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saula erawh chuan Lalpa zirtîrho a vau thu leh thah a tum thu a la chhâk chhuak ta cheu va. puithiam lalber hnênah a kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Damaska khuaa inkhâwmna in zawng zawnga mite hnêna pêk tûrin lehkhate a dîl a, Kawnga mi chu tu pawh a hmuh chuan hmeichhia pawh, mipa pawh, Jerusalem khuaah phuar chunga a hruai theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a kal laiin, Damaska khua a thlen dâwnin, thâwklehkhatan êng, vân ata a vêlin a lo êng ta phut a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tin, leiah a tlu a, a hnênah, “Saula, Saula, nangin engati nge mi tihduhdah?” tiin aw a hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan “Lalpa, tu nge i nih?” a ti a. Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Isua, i tihduhdah hi ka ni e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nimahsela, tho la, khuaah lût rawh; tichuan, i tih tûr an lo hrilh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a hnêna kal vete chu dang rengin an ding a, aw zawng an hre na a, tu mah an hmu si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Saula chu lei ata chu a tho va; tin, a han meng a, eng mah a hmu thei ta lo va; tichuan, a kutah an kai a, Damaska khuaah an hruai lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ni thum khaw hmu lovin a awm a, eng mah a eiin a in lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Damaska khuaah chuan a hming Anania, zirtîr pakhat a awm. Tin, Lalpa chuan mumang angin a hnênah, “Anani,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “En teh, Lalpa, heta hi ka awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Tho la, kawtthlêr, ‘Ngîl’ an tihah chuan kal la, Juda inah, Tarsa khuaa mi, a hming Saula zâwt chhuak rawh; ngai teh, a ṭawngṭai mêk a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a hming Anania mi pakhat, lûta a mit tivâr tûrin a chungah kut nghatin a hmu tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Anania chuan, “Lalpa, chu mi chuan Jerusalem khuaa i mi thianghlimte chunga a tihsual tamzia thu mi tam tak kaah ka hria a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tin, hetah pawh i hming lam apiang phuarna tûrin, puithiam lalte hnên ata thu a hmu reng asin,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Kal mai rawh; Jentail-te, lalte, Israela thlahte hnêna ka hming put luh nâna ka bêl ruat a ni alâwm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ka hming avânga hrehawm engtia nasa tuar tûr nge a nih amah ka la entir dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Anania chu a va kal a, inah chuan a va lût a; tin, a chungah a kut a nghat a, “Ka nau Saul, i mit vârna tûr leh, Thlarau Thianghlim khata i awm theih nân, Lalpa, i lo kalna kawnga i hnêna inlâr Isua khân mi rawn tîr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, thâwklehkhatan a mit ata phuhlip ang a tla ta nghal a, a mit a vâr leh ta a; tin, a tho va, baptisma a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, chaw a ei a, a lo harh leh ta a. Tin, Damaska khuaa zirtîrho awmte hnênah chuan ni eng emaw zât a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Inkhâwmna inahte chuan Isua chu Pathian Fapa a nihzia thu a tlângaupui ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a thu hretu zawng zawng chuan mak an ti hle a, “He mi hi Jerusalem khuaa he hming lamtute tiduhdah ṭhîn kha a ni lo vem ni? Chûng mite chu puithiam lalte hnêna phuar chunga hruai, a rawn kal chhan a nih kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saula erawh chu a lo chak lehzual a, chu mi chu Krista a ni tak zet tih a hrilhfiah a, Damaska khuaa Juda awmte chu a tidang hiau ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ni rei tak hnuah chuan Saula tihlum tûrin Juda-te chu an inrâwn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />nimahsela, Saula chuan an phiar thu chu a lo hre ta a. Tin, tihhlum tumin kulh kawngka tinah chuan a chhûn a zânin an châng ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, a zirtîrten ani chu an hruai a, zânah kulh tukverhah bâwmin an thlâk thla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Jerusalem khua a thlen veleh zirtîrhote chu pâwl a tum a; anni erawh chuan an zain ani chu an hlau va, zirtîr a ni ve tih an ring lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Barnaba erawh chuan ani chu a hruai a, tirhkohte hnênah chuan a rawn kalpui a, kalkawngah Lalpa a hmuha a biakzia te, Damaska khuaa Isua hminga huai taka thu a hrilzia te pawh chu an hnênah a sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chu Jerusalem khuaah chuan, an hnênah lût ṭhîn, chhuak ṭhînin a awm ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpa hmingin huai takin thu a hril ṭhîn a. Tin, Grik Juda-te hnênah thu a sawi a, a hnial a; anni erawh chuan ani chu tihhlum an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, unaute chuan chu chu an hriatin Kaisari khuaah an hruai chhuk a, Tarsa khuaah an tîr ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, kohhranhote chu Judai ram vêlah te, Galili ram vêlah te, Samari ram vêlah te chuan an nghet deuh deuh va, muang takin an awm ta a; tin, Lalpa ṭih dêkin, Thlarau Thianghlim thlamuanin an awm a, an lo pung ta telh telh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Peteran khua vêl a fan pahin Ludda khuaa mi thianghlim awmte hnênah a zuk kal bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutah chuan mi pakhat a hming Ainia, a zen avânga kum riat khuma mu reng a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Petera chuan a hnênah, “Aini, Isua Krista chuan a tidam a che; tho la, i âwngphah zial rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, a tho ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Ludda khua leh Saron phaia awmte zawng zawng chuan Ainia chu an hmu a, Lalpa lam an hawi ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Joppa khuaah a hming Tabithi, zirtîr pakhat a awm a (A Grik hming chu Dorki a ni a, ‘sazuklâ’ tihna a ni). Chu hmeichhia chuan thil tihṭhat leh thilpêk a ngah hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, chûng lai chuan a damlo va, a thi ta a; tin, an bual fai a, pindan chungnungah an zalh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Ludda khua chu Joppa khaw kiang a nih avângin, zirtîrteho chuan chutah chuan Petera a awm tih an hria a, “Rei rial lovin kan hnênah lo kal ang che,” tia ngên chiam tûrin a hnênah mi pahnih an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Petera chu a tho va, an hnênah a kal ve ta a. Tin, a thlen veleh pindan chungnungah chuan an hruai a; hmeithai zawng zawng chu a kianga dingin, Dorki an hnêna a awm laia a kawr siam te, a puan siamte entîr chungin an ṭap hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nimahsela, Petera chuan an zain a chhuahtîr vek a, a ṭhingṭhi a, a ṭawngṭai ta a; tin, a ruang lam a hawi a, “Tabith, tho rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, a mit a han meng a, Petera chu a hmuh veleh a ṭhu ta hlawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Petera chuan a kut a pe a, a kai tho ta a; tin, mi thianghlimte leh hmeithaite chu a ko va, damin a kawhhmuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, chu chu Joppa khua zawng zawng chuan an hre ta vek a; mi tam takin Lalpa chu an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, Petera chu Joppa khuaa Simona, savun siamtu inah ni tam tak a châm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Kaisari khuaah a hming Kornelia mi pakhat a awm a, Itali pâwl an tih, chumi pâwla sipai za hotu a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ngaihsak mi a ni a, a chhûngte zawng zawng nên Pathian an ṭih ṭhîn a, mite hnênah thil tam tak a pe ṭhîn a, Pathian hnênah pawh a ṭawngṭai fo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu mi chuan behliang mun hun lai vêlah, mumang angin fiah takin Pathian vântirhkoh pakhat a hnêna lûta, “Korneli,” tiin a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Kornelia chuan ani chu a lo en reng a, a hlau va, “Lalpa, eng nge ni?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “I ṭawngṭainate leh i thilpêk thute kha hriat reng tûrin Pathian hmaah a thleng chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tûnah Joppa khuaah mite tîr la, mi pakhat Simona, Petera an tiha chu, han hruaitîr rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />savun siamtu Simona hnênah a thleng a ni, a in chu tuifinriat kamah a awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh a betu chu a kal veleh, Kornelia chuan a chhiahhlawhte zînga mi pahnih leh a rawngbâwl fote zînga Pathian ngaihsak sipai pakhat a ko va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tin, thu zawng zawng chu an hnênah a hrilh zawhin Joppa khuaah chuan a tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan, an kal laia khaw kiang an thlen dâwnin, Petera chu ṭawngṭai tûrin, chawfâk hun laiin in chungah a lâwn chho va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tin, a ril a lo ṭâm a, chaw ei a duh ta a; nimahsela, ei tûr an siam lai chuan englovin a zêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, vân inhawngin englo bâwm, puan lian tak ang, a kil lia hlina leia uai thlain a hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />chumi chhûngah chuan fuliafa leh rannung leh chunglêng sava tinrêngte an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah awin, “Peter, tho rawh; talh la, ei rawh,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, Petera chuan, “Lalpa, ni lo ve; thiang lo leh bawlhhlawh eng mah rêng ka ei ngai lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, aw chuan a vawi hnihnaah, “Pathianin a tihthianghlim tawh chu nangin thiang lo ti suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutiang hlîr chuan vawi thum a lo awm a; tin, bâwm chu vâna khai chhohvin a awm leh ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Petera chuan mumang anga a hmuh chu a ngaihna hre lova a mangan laiin, Kornelia mi tirhte chuan Simona in chu an lo zâwt chhuak tawh a, kawngkhâr bulah an lo ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />an au va, Simona, Petera an tiha chu, chutah chuan a thlen leh thlen loh an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Petera chuan a mumang ang thu chu a ngaihtuah laiin Thlarauvin a hnênah, “Ngai teh, mi pathumin an zawng a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, tho la, chhuk la, eng mah ringhlel lovin anmahni zui rawh; anni chu ka tirh an ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Petera chu, chu mite hnênah chuan a chhuk a, an hnênah, “In zawn hi ka ni e; eng nge in rawn kal chhan?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Vântirhkoh thianghlim pakhatin Kornelia, sipai za hotu, mi fel tak, Pathian ṭih, Juda hnam zawng zawng zînga mi hmingṭha hnênah chuan i thusawi a hriat nân, a inah nangmah ko tûr chein a hrilh a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, mite chu a ko lût a, a riahtîr ta a. Tin, a tûkah chuan Petera chu a tho va, an hnênah a kal a, Joppa khuaa mi unau tute emaw pawh a hnênah an kal ve a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a tûk lehah Kaisari khuaah chuan an lût ta a. Tin, Kornelia chuan a laichînte leh a ṭhian duh berte ko khâwmin, anni chu a lo nghâk reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Petera chu a luh dâwn lai takin Kornelia chuan a lo hmuak a, a ke bulah a bawkkhup a, Pathian chibai bûk angin a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, Petera chuan ani chu a kai tho va, “Ding rawh, kei pawh mihring ka ni alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah thu sawi chungin a lût a, mi tam tak awm khâwm chu a va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Juda miin hnam dang pâwl leh an hnêna kal a thian lohzia nangnin in hria e; nimahsela, tu mah thiang lo leh bawlhhlawh ka ti tûr a ni lo tih Pathianin mi hriattîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi rawn koh veleh khân hnial lovin ka lo kal ta a nih hi. Tichuan, ka zâwt a che u, eng nge mi rawn koh chhan le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Kornelia chuan, “Ni li a ni ta, tûn hun ang thleng hian ka inah, behliang mun hun ṭawngṭainaah ka ṭawngṭai a; tin, ngai teh, mi pakhat puan êng tak sinin ka hmaah a lo ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘Korneli, i ṭawngṭaina kha hriatin a awm ta, mi hnêna i thilpêkte pawh kha Pathianin a hre reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuvângin, Joppa khuaah mi tîr la, Simona, Petera an tiha chu, i hnênah ko rawh; ani chu tuifinriat kamah savun siamtu Simona inah a thleng a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuvângin, i hnênah mi ka rawn tîr ta nghâl a ni; i lo kal hi a ṭha e. Chutichuan, Lalpan thu a pêk apiang che hre tûrin, tûnah Pathian mit hmuhin kan zain hetah kan awm a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Petera chuan a sawi a: “Pathianin mi duhsak bîk a nei lo tih dik takin ka hria e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />nimahsela, hnam tin zîngah tu pawh amah ṭiha, fel taka ti apiang a lâwm zâwng mi an ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ani chuan thlamuanna Chanchin Ṭha Isua Krista kâa hrilin, Israela thlahte hnênah thu a thawn a (Isua chu mi zawng zawng Lal a ni a),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Johanan a tlângaupui ṭhin baptisma zawhah khân, thu, Galili ram aṭanga lo thang ṭana, Judai ram zawng zawnga thang chhuak kha, nangnin in hre bawk alâwm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nazareth Isua chungchâng thu kha, khatia Pathianin ani chu Thlarau Thianghlim leh thiltihtheihnaa a vûrzia kha; ani chuan mi chunga tiṭha leh, Diabola tihduhdah zawng zawng tidamin a fang vêl ṭhîn a, a hnênah Pathian a awm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Juda-te ramah leh Jerusalem khuaa a thiltih zawng zawng hretute kan ni e; ani chu thinglêrah khaiin an tihlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pathianin ani chu ni thum nîah a kai tho leh a, fiah takin a entîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />amaherawhchu, mi zawng zawng hnênah a ni lo, Pathianin hretua a ruat lâwkate hnênah chauh a ni, keimahni, mitthi zîng ata a thawhleh hnua a hnêna eia bârte hnênah hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ani chu mitthite leh mi nungte chunga rorêltua Pathian ruat chu a ni tih, mi hnêna tlângaupui leh hriattîr tûrin Pathianin thu min pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tu pawh amah chu ring apiang, a hming avângin sualte ngaihhnathiamin an awm ang tih, hêng a chanchin hi zâwlnei zawng zawngin an hriattîr ṭhin kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, Peteran chûng thu a sawi lai tak chuan, thuhretu zawng zawng chungah chuan Thlarau Thianghlim a lo thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, serhtanho zînga ringtute, Petera rawn zui apiang chuan, Thlarau Thianghlim pêk chu Jentail-te chungah pawh leih a nih avângin mak an ti hle a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />ṭawnghriatlohtea thu sawiin Pathian fakin an hre si a. Tin, Peteran a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Hêng mite, keimahni anga Thlarau Thianghlim hmu ve hi, baptisma an chan loh nân miin tui hman an khap thei em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua Krista hminga baptisma chan tûr thu a pe a. Chûng zawhah chuan ni eng emaw zât châmah an ngên a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Judai rama tirhkoh leh unau awmte chuan, Jentail-te pawhin Pathian thu an zâwm tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Petera chu Jerusalem khua a thlen chhoh veleh serhtanhoten a hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Serhtanlote inah i lût a, an hnênah i ei vei a,” an ti a, an kalh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Petera chuan a bul aṭangin indawt zêlin an hnênah a hrilhfiah a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Joppa khuaah ṭawngṭaiin ka awm a; tin, englovin mi zêl a, mumang angin englo bâwm, puan lian tak ang, a kil lia hlina vân ata uai thla ka hmu a; ka kiangah ngei mi rawn hnaih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tin, chu chu ka en reng a, ka ngaihtuah a, leia mi fuliafate, ramsate, rannungte leh chunglêng savate ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, awin, ‘Peter, tho rawh; talh la, ei rawh,’ mi tiin ka hre bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, keiin, ‘Lalpa, ni lo ve; thiang lo leh bawlhhlawh eng mah rêng ka kaah a lût ngai lo,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, vân ata aw chuan a vawi hnihnaah, ‘Pathianin a tihthianghlim tawh chu nangin thiang lo ti suh,’ tiin mi chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutiang hlîr chuan vawi thum a lo awm a; tin, engkim chu vânah khai chhohvin a awm leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh u, mi pathum Kaisari khua ata ka hnênah an rawn tîr a, kan awmna kawtah chuan an lo ding reng tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tin, Thlarauvin tu mah thlei bîk lova anmahni zui tûrin mi tîr a. Hêng unau paruk pawh hian mi zui ve a, mi inah chuan kan lût a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, ani chuan kan hnênah, a ina vântirhkoh ding a hmuh thu leh, vântirhkoh chuan a hnênah, ‘Joppa khuaah mi tîr la, Simona, Petera an tiha chu han hruaitîr rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ani chuan thu a hrilh ang chia, chumi thu chuan nang leh i chhûngte chu chhandamin in awm ang,’ a tihzia pawh min hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, thu ka sawi tirhin, Thlarau Thianghlim kan chunga a lo thlen tirh lai ang bawk khân an chungah a lo thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu, ‘Johanan tuiin mi a baptis ṭhin kha; amaherawhchu, nangni zawng Thlarau Thianghlimin baptisma in la chang ang,’ a tihziate kha ka lo hre chhuak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa Isua Krista an rin veleh, Pathianin thilthlâwnpêk min pêk ang kha an hnêna a pêk ve ahnuin, kei tehlul hi Pathian hnial rual em ka nih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng thu chu an hriatin an ngawi ta a, “Chuti a nih chuan Pathianin Jentail-te pawh nung atân sim a phal ta a nih tak chu,” tiin Pathian an fak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Stephana avânga an tihduhdaha darhte kha, Phoiniki ram te, Kupra thliarkâr te, Antiokei khua te thlengin an kal a, Juda-te hnênah chauh lo chuan tu hnênah mah thu chu an hril lo zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, an zînga a ṭhen chu Kupra thliarkâr leh Kurini khuaa mite an ni a, chûng mite chuan Antiokei khua chu an thlenin Grik-te hnênah pawh thu an sawi a, Lalpa Isua Chanchin Ṭha chu an hrilh ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa kutin anmahni a ṭanpui a; mi tam takin an ring a. Lalpa lam chu an hawi ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, an chanchin thu chu Jerusalem khuaa kohhran awmte bengah chuan a lo lût ta a; chutichuan, Antiokei khaw thleng chuan Barnaba chu an tîr chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a va thleng a, Pathian khawngaihzia chu a hmuh chuan a lâwm hle a, ṭhahnemngai taka Lalpa vuan reng tûrin an zain a fuih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Barnaba chu mi ṭha tak a ni a, Thlarau Thianghlim leh rinnaa khat a ni. Tin, mi tam takin Lalpa hnênah an tel belhchhah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Barnaba chu Saula zawng tûrin Tarsa khuaah a kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tin, a hmuh chuan Antiokei khuaah chuan a rawn hruai a. Tin, kum khat zet kohhrante inkhâwmnaah chuan an tel ve ṭhîn a, mi tam tak an zirtîr bawk ṭhîn a. Antiokei khuaah chuan a ni zirtîrteho chu ‘Kristian’ an tih hmasak ber ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, chûng lai chuan zâwlnei tute emaw, Jerusalem khua aṭangin Antiokei khuaah chuan an zuk kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, an zînga mi pakhat, a hming Agaba chu a ding a, khawvêl zawng zawngah ṭâm nasa tak a tla dâwn tih Thlarau hrilhin a hriattîr a; chu ṭâm chu Klaudia lal laiin a lo thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, zirtîrteho chuan an theih tâwk ṭheuhvin, Judai rama unau awmte hnênah chuan chhawmdâwlna tûr thawn an tum a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />chu chu an ti ta ngei a, Barnaba leh Saula kutah chuan upate hnênah an thawn ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chutih lai vêl chuan, Lal Herodan kohhrante zînga tute emaw tihduhdah tumin a kut a lek ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Jakoba, Johana unau chu, khandaihin a sât hlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu chuan Juda-te a tilâwm tih a hriatin Petera pawh chu man a tum lehzêl a (Chûng nite chu chhang dawidim telh loh ni a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a man hnuah chuan tân inah a khung a, sipai pâwl li, pali ṭheuh zêlin a vên chhâwktîr a; Kalhlên Kût zawhah mi zawng zawng hnênah hruai chhuah a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, Petera chu tân inah chuan a awmtîr rih a; nimahsela, kohhranhovin ama tân ṭhahnemngai takin Pathian hnênah an ṭawngṭaisak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Heroda chuan a hruai chhuah dâwnin, chumi zân takah chuan Petera chu sipai pahnih inkârah khaidiat pahnih bunin a muhîl a; a vêngtute pawh kawngkhâr bulah an awm a, tân in chu an vêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Lalpa vântirhkoh pakhat a kiangah a lo ding a, ripah chuan êng eng emaw a lo êng a; tin, Petera nâkah a bêng harh a, “Tho thuai rawh,” a ti a. Tin, a khaidiatte chu a kut ata a tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chuan a hnênah, “Puan veng la, i pheikhawk bun rawh,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan chutiangin a ti a. Tin, vântirhkoh chuan a hnênah, “I puan bât ṭha la, mi zui rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Petera chu a chhuak a, a zui ta a; vântirhkoh chêtzia chu a tak a ni tih a hre lo va, mumanga a hmuh emaw a ti zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, vêngtu tawntirh leh a dawttu an pelh hnu chuan, pâwn chhuahna tûr thîr kawngkhâr chu an va thleng a, chu chu an tân a inhawng chawp ta a; tin, an chhuak a, kawtthlêr pakhat an pêl a; tin, vântirhkoh chuan a kalsan ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Petera chuan a harh veleh, “Lalpan a vântirhkoh a tîr chhuak a, Heroda kuta mi leh Juda mite beiseina zawng zawng ata mi chhandam tih tûnah dik takin ka hre ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a inngaihtuah zawhin, Johana, Marka an tih, chu mi nu Mari inah chuan a va kal a; chutah chuan ṭawngṭaiin mi tam tak an lo awm khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, sumhmun kawngkhâr a kik veleh a hming Rodi, nula pakhat, chhâng tûrin a va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Petera aw a hriat veleh, a lâwm avângin kawng chu hawng lovin a tlân lût leh ta zâwk a, kawngkhâr bulah Petera a ding tih a va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni chuan a hnênah, “I â ta a nih hi,” an lo ti a. Ani erawh chu, “Tihtak zet a ni,” tiin a ṭang ṭâlh a. Tin, anni chuan, “A vântirhkoh a nih chu,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, Petera chuan a kik reng a; tin, an han hawn chuan amah chu an hmu a, mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, ani chuan an ngawihna tûrin kutin a zâp a, Pathianin tân in ata amah a hruai chhuahziate chu a hrilh ta a. Tin, “Hêng thu hi Jakoba leh unaute va hrilh rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, a chhuak a, hmun dangah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ni a chhuah veleh sipaihote chu, “Petera kha khawiah nge a awm tâk?” tiin buai namênin an buai ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Heroda chuan a zawng a, a hmu si lo va, a vêngtute chu a chhuahchhâl a, tihhlum tûrin thu a pe ta a. Tin, Heroda chu Judai ram ata Kaisari khuaah a zuk kal a, chutah chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Tura leh Sidon khuaa mite chungah chuan a lungni lo êm êm a; tin, anni chuan Blasta, lal khum vêngtu chu ṭhianah an siam a, thu khat vuain a hnênah an lo kal a, an khaw lamin lal khaw lama pûr chaw ṭhîn an nih avângin rem an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a ni tiam niin Heroda chuan lal puan a sin a, lalṭhutphahah a ṭhu a, an hnênah thu a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawng chuan, “Pathian aw a nih hi, mihring aw a ni lo ve,” an ti a, an au ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Pathian hnênah chawimawina chu a pêk loh avângin, Lalpa vântirhkohvin chawplehchilhin a man a, rûlhûtin a ei a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian thu erawh chu a darh a, a pung ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Barnaba leh Saula chuan rawng chu an bâwl zawhin, Jerusalem khua ata chu an kîr leh ta a, Johana, Marka an tiha chu an hnênah an hruai a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Antiokei khuaa kohhranho awmte zîngah chuan thuhriltute leh zirtîrtute an awm; chûng chu Barnaba te, Sumeona, Nigera an tih te, Kurini khuaa mi Lukia te, Lal Heroda unau tûr Manaina te, Saula te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa rawng an bâwla, chaw an nghei laiin Thlarau Thianghlimin, “Barnaba leh Saula hi anmahni ka ruat chhan ti tûrin mi tihhransak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, chaw an ngheia an ṭawngṭai zawh chuan an chungah kut an nghat a, an kaltîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Thlarau Thianghlim tirh chhuahin an kal a, Selukai khuaah an chhuk a, chuta ṭangin Kupra thliarkârah lawngin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Salamis khuaa an awm laiin, Juda inkhâwmna inahte Pathian thu an hril ṭhîn a; Johana pawh kha an rawng bâwl tûrin an hruai ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, thliarkâr chu Paphos khaw thlengin an fang chhuak a, dawithiam, zâwlnei der, Juda mi pakhat an hmu a, a hming chu Barisua a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu mi chu lal aiawhtu, Serjia Paula, mi fing tak hnêna awm a ni a. Chu lal aiawhtu chuan Barnaba leh Saula chu a ko va, Pathian thu hriat a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, Eluma (Barisua hming dang, a awmzia hi Dawithiam a ni a) chuan lal aiawhtu chu rin lohtîr tumin anni chu a lo dodâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula (Paula an tih bawk) chu Thlarau Thianghlimin a khat a, ani chu a en reng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nang mi bum leh huatthlalâk tinrênga khatpa, nang Diabola fapa, nang fel tinrêng malmâkpa, Lalpa kawng fel takte hi tihchhiat i bâng lo vang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hre rawh, tûnah Lalpa kut i chungah a tla a nih hi, i mit a lo del ang a, khaw êng i hmu rih lo vang,” a ti a. Tichuan, chhûm leh thimin amah chu a bawh ta nghâl a, kuta kaitu tûr zawngin a vâk a vâk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, lal aiawhtu chuan chu thiltih chu a hmu a, Lalpa zirtîr thu chu mak a ti hle a, a ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Paula chu a hote nên chuan Paphos khua aṭang chuan lawngin an kal a, Pamphulia rama Perga khua an thleng a; tin, Johana khân anni chu a kalsan a, Jerusalem khuaah a kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni chu Perga khua ata an kal zêl a, Pisidia rama Antiokei khua an thleng a; tin, Chawlhniah inkhâwmna inah an lût a, an ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Dân Lehkhabu leh Zâwlneite Lehkhabu chhiar zawhin, inkhâwmna in hotuten an hnênah mi an tîr a, “Unaute u, mite fuihna thu eng emaw in neih chuan sawi rawh u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Paula chu a ding a, kutin a zâp a, “Israel mite leh Pathian ṭihtute u, ngai teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hêng Israel chite Pathian hian min thlahtute a thlang a, Aigupta rama an thang lai khân a chawimawi a, chungnung kutin chuta ṭang chuan a hruai chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, kum sawmli lai thlalêrah khân an thiltihte chu a en thei reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Kanaan rama hnam sarih a tihtlâwm hnu khân, an ram chu luah tûrin a pe zêl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />kum zali leh sawmnga chhûng zawng khân. Chûng hnuah chuan rorêltute a pe ṭhîn a, zâwlnei Samuela thleng khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan lal an dîl a; tichuan, Pathianin Saula, Kisa fa, Benjamin chia mi kha an hnênah a pe a, kum sawmli chhûng atân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a sawn bo hnu khân an lal atân Davida a siam ta a; Pathianin chumi thu chu hriattîrin, ‘Davida, Jesaia fa, ka thinlung ang pu mi ka chhar ta, ani chuan ka duh zâwng ang apiang a ti ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu mi thlahte zîngah chuan Pathianin, thutiam ang zêlin, Israel-ho hnênah Chhandamtu Isua a rawn thlen a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a lo kal hmain Johanan simna baptisma thu, Israel mi zawng zawng hnênah a lo hrilh tê tê a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Johanan a rawngbâwlna a zawh dâwn lai khân, ‘Nangnin tu-ah nge mi ruat? Ani chu ka ni lo ve. Nimahsela, ngai teh u, ka hnuah mi tu emaw a lo kal dâwn a ni, kei hi zawng a kephaha pheikhawk phelh tlâk pawh ka ni lo ve,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Unaute u, Abrahama thlaha fate u, in zînga Pathian ṭih zawng zawngte u, keimahniho hnênah hian hêng chhandamna thu hi min rawn thawn chhuak a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaa awmten an hotute nên, ani chu an hriat loh avâng leh zâwlneite thu, Chawlhni apianga chhiar ṭhin kha, an hriat hek loh avângin, ani chu thiam loh chantîrin, chumi thu chu an hlen ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A thihna khawp meuh a chungah eng mah an hmuh loh pawhin, Pilata hnênah tihhlum an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, a thu zâwlneiten an ziak lâwk zawng zawng kha a hlen zawhin, thing ata chu an la thla a, thlânah an zalh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathianin mitthi zîng ata a kai tho leh ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tin, Galili ram ata Jerusalem khuaa ama ruala chho vete hnênah chuan ni tam tak chhûng a inlâr ṭhîn a; chûng mite chu tûnah hian mi hnênah a thuhretute an ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Keini pawhin thlahtute hnêna thutiam kha, a chanchin lâwmawm kan rawn hrilh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khatia Pathianin Isua a kaihthawhah khân, kan fate hnênah hian chûng chu a hlen a ni; Sam pahnihnaah, ‘Ka Fapa i ni e, vawiinah hian ka hring a che,’ tih ziak ang bawk khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ṭawihna hmuna kal leh lo tûrin, Pathianin ani chu mitthi zîng ata a kaihthawh tûrzia thu chu heti hian a sawi, ‘Davida hnêna khawngaihna ka tiam tlatte kha nangmah ka pe ang che,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuvângin, hla dangah, ‘I Mi Thianghlima chu ṭawih ral i phal lo vang,’ a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Davida zawng, Pathian rorêlsak angin a dam rualpuite rawng a bâwl zawhah khân a muhîl a, a thlahtute hnênah an zalh a, a ṭawih ral tawh alâwm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pathian kaihthawh erawh kha chu a ṭawih ral loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutichuan, unaute u, hre rawh u; amah avâng chuan sual ngaihhnathiamna thu in hnênah hrilh a nih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tu pawh a ring apiang engkimah ama thiam chantîrin an awm, chûngah chuan Mosia dânin thiam chantîrin in awm thei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chuvângin, fîmkhur rawh u; chuti lo chuan, zâwlneite lehkhabua an sawi kha in chungah a lo thleng dah ang e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />‘Hmusittute u, en rawh u, Mak ti ula, boral rawh u; In dam chhûng hian thil kawng khat ka tih hi, Chu thil chu miin hrilh che u mah sela, In âwih tawp lo vang,’ tih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, an chhuahin Chawlhni lehah chûng thu chu sawi leh tûrin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmhote chu an ṭîn veleh, Juda-te leh an saphun Pathian ngaihsak zînga mi tam takin Paula leh Barnaba chu an zui zêl a; anni chuan an lo bia a, Pathian khawngaihnaah chuan awm reng tûrin an fuih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, Chawlhni lehah chuan a khua thawin Pathian thu ngaithla tûrin an rawn inkhâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda-ten mipuite chu an hmuh veleh an îtsîk êm êm mai a; Paula thusawi chu an hnialkalh a, an sâwt hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Paula leh Barnaba chuan huai takin an sawi chhuak a, “Pathian thu hi nangmahni hnênah sawi hmasak tûr rêng a ni; nimahsela, in hnar kîr a, chatuana nung tlâk lova in inruat tâk ahnuin, hre rawh u, Jentail-te lam kan hawi ta ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Lalpan thu min pe a ni, ‘Jentail-te tiêngtuah ka ruat a che, Kâwlkil thlenga chhandamtua i awm theihna tûrin,’ tih ziak ang khan,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, Jentail-te chuan chûng thu chu an hriatin an lâwm a, Pathian chu an chawimawi a; tin, chatuana nung tûra ruat apiang chuan an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu chumi ram khua vêlah chuan a darh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda-te chuan hmeichhe zahawm, Pathian ngaihsakte leh khuaa upahote chu an fuih a, Paula leh Barnaba chu an tihduhdahtîr a, an ram ata an hnawt chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan an chungah an kephaha vaivut an thing thla a, Ikonion khua an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrhote chu lâwmna leh Thlarau Thianghlimin an khat hlawm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Ikonion khuaah chuan Juda-te inkhâwmna inah an lût dûn a, thu an sawi ṭhîn a; chutichuan, Juda leh Grik tam tak pawhin an ring ta hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nimahsela, ring duh lo Juda-ten Jentail-te an fuihpawrh a, unaute chu an huattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpaah huai taka thu sawiin chutah chuan rei fe an awm a, ani chuan chhinchhiahna leh thilmakte an kuta tihtîrin, a khawngaih thu a hriattîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, khuaa mipuite chu an inkhing ta a; a ṭhenin Juda-te chu an ṭan a, a ṭhenin tirhkohte chu an ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Jentail-te, Juda-te, an hotute nên chuan tirhkohte chu zahthlâk taka siam leh lunga den tuma an beih dâwn laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />anni chuan an lo hria a, Lukaoni ram vêkah chuan Lustra leh Derbe khuaahte leh a vêl ramahte an tlân bo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chûngah chuan Chanchin Ṭha an hril zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lustra khuaah chuan ke zeng tu emaw a ṭhu ṭhîn a, a pian tirh ata kebai rêng a ni a, kein a kal ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu mi chuan Paula thusawi a ngaithla a; tin, Paula chuan ani chu a en reng a, damna tûrin rinna a nei tih a hria a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />aw ring takin, “I kein ding ngîl rawh,” a ti a. Tin, ani chu a zuang tho va, kein a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, mipuiten Paula thiltih chu an hmuh veleh Lukaoni ṭawngin ring takin, “Pathiante chu mihring angin kan hnênah an lo chhuk ta a nih hi!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Barnaba chu “Jupita” an ti a, Paula chu thusawitu zâwk a nih avângin “Merkuria” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Jupita, a biak in dai pâwna awm chu, a puithiamin sebâwngpate leh pangpâr ṭhi hruite kawngkhâr kiangahte a rawn la a, mipuite nên chuan biak nân talh an tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, tirhkoh Barnaba leh Paula chuan chu chu an hriat veleh an puan an pawt thlêr a, mipui zîngah chuan an zuang lût a, an au va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Pute u, hêng thil hi engah nge in tih? Keini pawh in nungchang ang pu mihring kan nih hi; hêng thil lawilote hi in hawisana, vân te, lei te, tuifinriat te, a chhûnga awm zawng zawng nêna siamtu Pathian nung hnênah chuan in lo pakaina tûrin Chanchin Ṭha kan rawn thlen che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu Pathian chuan hmânlaiin hnam tin mahni kawng ṭheuh zawh a phal ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />nimahsela, amah hriattîrna awm lovin a insiam lo; chutin thil a tiṭha ṭhîn a, vân ata ruahte leh kum ṭhat kumte a pe che u a, in rilru ei tûr leh lâwmnain a tihkhah ṭhin che u kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chuan mipuiten anmahni biak nâna ran an talh tûr chu an khap zo ta hrâm hrâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Antiokei leh Ikonion khuaa Juda tute emaw chutah chuan an lo kal a, mipuite chu an thlêm thlu ta a; tichuan, Paula chu lungin an dêng a, thia an rin avângin khua ata chu an hnûk chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, zirtîrhote chu a vêla an din laiin a lo tho va, khuaah chuan a lût leh ta a. Tin, a tûkah chuan Barnaba nên Derbe khuaah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chumi khuate hnênah chuan Chanchin Ṭha an hrilh a, zirtîr tam tak an siam hnuin Lustra khuaah te, Ikonion khuaah te, Antiokei khuaah te an kîr leh zêl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Hrehawm tam tak tuarin Pathian ramah kan lût tûr a ni rêng a ni,” tiin zirtîrhote rilru an tinghet a, rinnaah chuan awm reng tûrin an fuih zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, kohhran pâwl tinah chuan upate an ruatsak a, chaw nghei chunga an ṭawngṭai zawhin, an rin Lalpa hnênah chuan an kawltîr zêl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Pisidia ram chu an fang chhuak a, Pamphulia ram an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Perga khuaa thu an hril zawhin Attalia khuaah an zuk kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />chuta ṭang chuan lawngin an chhuak a, Antiokei khua chu an thleng leh ta a, chu chu an thiltih zawh tâk chu ti tûra unauten Pathian khawngaihna kawltîra an chhuahtîrna kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, an thlen hnuin kohhranhote chu an ko khâwm a, Pathianin anmahni hmanga thil a tih zawng zawngte leh, Jentail-te tâna rinna kawngkhâr a hawnsakziate chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrhote hnênah chuan rei fe an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, mi tute emaw Judai ram ata an lo chhuk a, “Mosia dân anga serh in tantîr loh chuan chhandam in ni thei lo vang,” tiin unaute chu an zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Paula leh Barnaba chu anmahni nên inhnial namêna an inhnial lohva, an inkhin tlat avângin, Paula leh Barnaba chu an zînga tute emaw nên, chu thubuai chungah chuan, Jerusalem khuaa tirhkohte leh upate hnênah chho tûrin an ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, kohhrante chuan an han thlah a, anni chuan Jentail-te hawi kîr lehzia thu chu hril zêlin, Phoiniki ram leh Samari ram an fang chhuak ta a; tichuan, unaute zawng zawng an tilâwm êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khua an han thlen chuan kohhranhote, tirhkohte, upate chuan an lo lâwm a; tin, Pathianin anmahni hmanga thil a tih zawng zawngte chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pharisai pâwla mi, ring ve tute emaw an tho va, “Jentail-te chu an serhtan tûr a ni, Mosia dân âwih pawh an hnênah tiam kher tûr a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, tirhkohte leh upate chu, chumi thu chu ngaihtuah tûrin an inkhâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, an inhnial chiam hnuin Petera a tho va, an hnênah, “Unaute u, Jentail-ten keima kâa Chanchin Ṭha thu hriaa âwih tûra, Pathianin hmâna in zîng ata mi ruatzia kha in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, rilru hretu Pathianin keini min pêk ang bawk khân Thlarau Thianghlim an hnênah pe vein, an chungah a lâwm tih a hriattîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tin, keini leh anni thlei bîk lovin rinin an rilru a tithianghlim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, min thlahtu leh keini zawh tawh loh nghâwngkawl kha, tûnah zirtîrhote chunga nghah tumin engati nge Pathian fin in hnial kalh le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anmahni rin ang bawk hian keini pawhin Lalpa Isua khawngaihna avânga chhandam tûr niin kan inring si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, mipui zawng zawng chu an ngawi reng a, Barnaba leh Paulan Pathianin anmahni hmanga Jentail-te zînga chhinchhiahna leh thilmak a tih thu kha an hrilh chhûng zawng an ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, an sawi zawhin Jakoban a sawi ve thung a: “Unaute u, ka thu ngaithla rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathianin ama hming pu atân an zîng ata mite la chhuak tûrin, Jentail-te a kan ṭan tirh dân chu Sumeona hian a sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu leh zâwlneite thu hi a inhmeh a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Chûng zawhah chuan ka kîr leh ang a, Davida bâwkte chim kha ka siam leh ang a, A chhe lai apiang pawh ka rem chho leh ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi dang, Jentail zawng zawng ka hming mi ṭâwmhote chuan, Lalpa an zawn nân. Chu bâwktê chu ka tungding ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khawvêl siam tirh ata hêng thu hriattîr ṭhîntu Lalpa chuan a ti e, tih ziak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, heti hian ka ruat a ni, Jentail-te zînga Pathian lam hawite chu tihrehawm lo ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />milem biakna thil bawlhhlawh ei te, inngaih te, sa reh hlum leh thisen eite bânna tûrin an hnênah lehkha thawn zâwk ila ka ti ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mosian hmânlai ata tawh khaw tinah a thu tlângaupuitu a nei ṭhîn si a, inkhâwmna inahte Chawlhni apiangin a thu chu chhiar a nih ṭhin kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, tirhkohte, upate, kohhran zawng zawngte nên chuan, an pâwla mi thlana, Paula leh Barnaba hnênah Antiokei khuaa kaltîr ṭha an ti a; an thlante hming chu Juda (Barsabba an tih) leh Sila an ni, chu mite chu unaute zînga hotu deuh an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, hetiang hian an ziak a, an kutah an thawn a: “Tirhkohte leh unaute zînga upaten Antiokei khua te, Suria ram te leh Kilikia rama Jentail unau awmte chibai an bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Kan pâwl zînga mi tuten emaw thu sawiin an tibuai che u a, in rilru an timangang tih kan hria e, an hnênah thu eng mah kan pe si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvângin, thu khat vuaa kan inkhâwmin, kan duh tak Barnaba leh Paula, Lalpa Isua Krista hming avânga thih dâwn lote kal rual hian, mi thlante in hnêna rawn kaltîr ve ṭha kan ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda leh Sila kan rawn tîr a nih hi, anni pawhin hêng thu bawk hi ṭawngkain an hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thlarau Thianghlim leh keinin, hêng thu pawimawh lo hi chu, phurrit zual in chungah nghat lo ila a ṭha kan ti;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />milem biakna sa ei te, sa thisen ei te, sa reh hlum ei te, inngaih te bâng ula kan ti; hêng hi in bân chuan in tân a ṭha ang. Dam takin awm rawh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, an tirhin an kal a, Antiokei khua chu an zuk thleng a; tin, mipui an ko khâwm a, lehkha chu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, an chhiar zawhin thlamuanna thu avâng chuan an lo lâwm ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Juda leh Sila chu zâwlnei an ni bawk a, thu tam takin unaute chu an thlamuan a, an tinghet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan rei deuh an awm hnuin, anmahni tîrtute hnêna hâwng leh tûrin, unaute chuan thlamuang takin an chhuahtîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Paula leh Barnaba erawh chu Antiokei khuaah chuan Lalpa thu zirtîr leh hrilin an awm reng a, mi dang tam tak nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ni eng emaw zât hnuah chuan Paulan Barnaba hnênah, “Tûnah kal leh ila, khaw tina Lalpa thu kan hrilhna apianga unau awmte kha kan zêl ila, an awm dân i en ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Barnaban Johana (Marka an tih chu) an hnênah hruai a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Paula erawh chuan ani chu an hnêna hruai ṭha a ti lo, Pamphulia ramah anmahni a kîrsana, hnathawhnaa an hnêna a kal ve tâk loh avâng khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, nasa takin an inhnial ta a; chutichuan, an inṭhen a, Barnaban Marka chu a hnênah a hruai a, Kupra thliarkâr lamah lawngin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Paula erawh chuan Sila a thlang a, unauten Lalpa khawngaihnaa an kawltîr hnuin a kal chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, kohhrante chu tinghet zêlin Suria leh Kilikia ram a fang chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Derbe khuaah leh Lustra khuaah chuan a kal bawk a; tin, chutah chuan a hming Timothea, zirtîr pakhat a awm; ani chu ring ve Juda hmeichhe fapa a ni a, a pa erawh chu Grik a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lustra leh Ikonion khuaa unau awmte chuan ani chu an fak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paulan ani chu an hnêna kal veah a duh a; tichuan, chumi lama Juda awmte avâng chuan a serh a tansak a, a pa chu Grik a ni tih an hre vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, khaw tina an kal pahin, Jerusalem khuaa tirhkoh leh upa awmte thurêl kha zawm atân unaute hnênah an pe zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, kohhrante chu rinnaah chuan an nghet ta a, ni tin an pung ta deuh deuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Thlarau Thianghlimin Asia rama thuhril a khap avângin, Phrugia leh Galatia ram chu an fang chhuak ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tin, Musia ram kiang an thlenin Bithunia rama luh an tum a; nimahsela, Isua thlarauvin a phal si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Musia ram chu an pêl a, Troas khuaah an chhuk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, zânah Paulan mumang angin Makedonia rama mi pakhat dingin, “Makedonia ramah lo kai la, min pui rawh,” tia ngên chiamin a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, chu mang chu a man zawh veleh Makedonia ramah chuan kal kan tum ta nghâl a, an hnêna Chanchin Ṭha hrilah Pathianin min ko tih kan hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Troas khua ata lawngin kan chhuak a, tluang takin Samothraki khuaah kan kal a, a tûkah chuan Neapoli khuaah kan kal leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tin, chuta ṭang chuan Philippi khuaah kan kal a, chumi khua chu Makedonia rama khaw pakhat a ni a, chumi bialah chuan khaw pawimawh ber a ni a, Rom khuaa mi pêmte khua a ni. Chumi khuaah chuan ni tam deuh kan châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Chawlhniah chuan kulh kawngkhâr pâwn lamah, lui kamah, ṭawngṭaina hmun nia kan rinah chuan kan kal a; tin, kan ṭhu a, hmeichhe lo kal khâwmhote hnênah chuan thu kan sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a hming Ludi, puan sen duk zuartu, Thuatira khuaa mi, Pathian betu hmeichhe pakhatin kan thu a hria a; tin, Paula thusawi chu zâwm tûrin Lalpan a thinlung a tivâr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, amah leh a chhûngten baptisma an chan zawhin, “Lalpa ring takzeta mi ruat chuan, ka inah lo thleng rawh u,” tiin min ngên chiam a, min chelh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ṭawngṭaina hmunah chuan kan kal laiin, nula tu emaw ramhuai aienthiam zâwlin min tâwk a, ani chuan a aien avângin a pute chu sum tam tak a hmuhtîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chu mi chuan Paula leh keini min zui a, “Hêng mi chhandamna kawng hrilhtu che u hi, Chungnungber Pathian bâwih an nih hi,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutiang chuan ni rei tak a ti ṭhîn a. Chutichuan, Paula chu a lungni ta lo va, a hawi a, ramhuai hnênah chuan, “Isua Krista hmingin a kawchhûng ata chhuah thu ka pe a che,” a ti a. Tin, chutih lai tak chuan a chhuak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a pute chuan an sum hmuhna a bo tih an hriatin, Paula leh Sila chu an man a, hotute hmaah dâwr hmunah an hnûk lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, rorêltute hnênah an hruai a, “Hêng mite hi Juda-te an ni a, kan khua an tibuai êm êm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />dân eng emaw kan lawm leh zawm thiang lote hi an hril ṭhîn a, Rom mi kan ni si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite pawh chu tirhkohte bei tûrin an lo thawk ve a, rorêltute chuan an puante an phih hlihsak a, tianga vuak thu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, vawi tam tak an vuak zawhin tân inah an khung a, a vêngtu hnênah him taka vên tûr an ti tlat a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />chuti kauva thu an pêk avâng chuan ani chuan rip chhûngnungah a khung a, an keahte chuan thingkawl a buntîr tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, zanlaiah Paula leh Sila chu Pathian hnênah an ṭawngṭai a, hla an sa a, mi tângten an ngaithla a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tin, thawklehkhatah lîr nasa takin a lo nghîng a; chutichuan, tân in lungphûmte lam chu a nghîng a; tin, kawngkhâr zawng zawng chu a inhawng nghâl a, mi tin kawlbunte chu a lo inphelh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, a vêngtu chu a muhîl a lo harh a, tân in kawngkhârte chu inhawngin a hmu a, mi tângte chu an tlan bo emaw a ti a, a khandaih a phawi a, a intihlum dâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nimahsela, Paula chu aw ring takin a au va, “Eng mah intih suh; kan zain hetah kan la awm vek alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, a vêngtu chuan khâwnvârte a lam a, a zuang lût a, hlauva khûr chungin Paula leh Sila hmaah chuan a bawkkhup a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tin, anni chu a hruai chhuak a, “Pute u, chhandama awm tûrin eng nge ka tih tûr?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Lalpa Isua ring la; tichuan, chhandamin i awm ang, nang leh i chhûngte nên,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah leh a ina awm zawng zawng hnênah chuan Lalpa thu an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, chumi zânah, chumi lai la la chuan a hruai a, an vuakna vualte chu a sil fai a; tin, ani leh a chhûngte zawng zawng chuan baptisma an chang ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, a inah a hruai chho va, ei tûr a hlui a; tin, Pathian an rin avângin, ani chu a chhûngte zawng zawng nên an hlim ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, ni a chhuahin rorêltute chuan, “Kha mite kha chhuah rawh,” tiin mi mantute an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, tân in vêngtu chuan Paula hnênah an thu a hrilh a, “Rorêltute chuan chhuah tûr che uin mi an rawn tîr a ni; chuvângin, tûnah lo chhuak ula, thlamuang takin kal rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nimahsela, Paula chuan an hnênah, “Rom mi kan ni si a, kan thiam leh thiam loh hre lovin vântlâng mit hmuhin min vua a, tân inah min khung a; tûnah hian a rûkin min hnawt chhuak dâwn vei a ni maw? A ni tawp lo vang; anmahni ngei lo kal sela, min rawn hruai chhuak rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi mantute chuan chûng thu chu rorêltute hnênah chuan an hrilh a. Tin, Rom mi an ni tih an hriat chuan an hlau ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tin, an va kal a, an thlêm chiam a, an hruai chhuak a, khua ata chu kal bovah an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, tân in ata chu an chhuak a, Ludi inah chuan an lût a; tin, unaute chu an hmu a, an thlamuan a, an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Amphipoli khua leh Apollonia khua an kal pêl a, Thessalonika khua an thleng ta a, chutah chuan Juda-te inkhâwmna in a awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, Paula chu a dân pângngaiin an hnênah a lût a, Chawlhni vawi thum Pathian Lehkha Thu aṭangin khûn taka chhûtpuiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Krista chu hrehawm tuar tûr rêng a nihzia te, mitthi zîng ata pawh tho leh tûr rêng a nihzia te chu a hrilhfiah a, a tilang ṭhîn a; “He Isua, a thu ka hrilh che u hi, amah hi Krista chu a ni,” a ti bawk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, an zînga ṭhenkhat chu thlêm thlûkin an awm a, Paula leh Sila chu an pâwl ta a; Pathian ngaihsak Grik mipui tam tak leh hmeichhe puipa tam tak nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda-ten an huphurh a; dâwr hmuna mi sual thatchhia tute emaw an hnênah an hruai a, mipui an ko khâwm a, khua zawng zawng chu an chawk buai a; Jasona in chu an rawn ṭhâwng a, vântlâng hnêna hruai chhuah tumin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, anni chu an hmu lo va, Jasona leh unau dang tute emaw chu khaw hotute hnênah an hnûk lût a, an au va, “Khawvêl chawk buaitute kha hetah pawh an lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jasona hian a lo thleng vei a; hêngho zawng zawng hi, ‘A hming Isua, lal dang a awm,’ tiin, Kaisara thu kalhin an awm ṭhîn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, mipui leh khaw hotute chuan chûng thu chu an han hriat chuan an buai ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tin, Jasona leh mi dangte hnên ata chu an aia hrên tûr englo an la a, an chhuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, unaute chuan a zân a zânin Paula leh Sila chu Beroia khuaah an kaltîr ta nghâl a; chuta an va thlen chuan Juda-te inkhâwmna inah an lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuta mite chu Thessalonika khuaa mite ai chuan an lo ṭha zâwk a; chutichuan, rilru lâwm takin thu chu an pawm a, an thusawi chu a dik leh dik loh hriat nân ni tin Pathian Lehkhaah an zawng ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, chûngho zînga mi tam tak chuan an ring ta a; Grik hmeichhe zahawmte leh mipate pawh duaiin an ring ta lo bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, Thessalonika khuaa Juda-hote chu, Paulan Beroia khuaah Pathian thu a hril tih an hriat veleh, chutah pawh chuan an va kal a, mipui an fuihpawrh a, an tibuai leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, unaute chuan tuifinriat thlenga kal tûrin Paula chu an tîr chhuak ta nghâl a, Sila leh Timothea erawh chu chutah chuan an la awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Paula hruaitute chuan Atheni khaw thlengin an hruai a; tin, Sila leh Timothea chu theihtâwpa a hnêna kal thuaina tûr thuchah sinin an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Paulan Atheni khuaah anni chu a lo nghah lai chuan, khua chu pathian lema khatin a hmu a, a rilruin a helh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, inkhâwmna inah Juda-te leh Jentail, Pathian ngaihsakte a hnial ṭhîn a, dâwr hmunah pawh chuta lo awm apiangte chu ni tin a hnial bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Epikuria mi leh Stoik mi zînga mi fing tute emaw pawhin ani chu an rawn hnial a. A ṭhenin, “He mi kamtam hian eng nge sawi a tum?” an ti a. A ṭhenin (Isua thu leh thawhlehna thu a hril avângin) “Ram dang pathiante thu hriltu a ni âwm e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ani chu an chelh a, Areopagi-ah chuan an rawn hruai a, a hnênah, “He zirtîrna thar i sawi ṭhin hi min hriattîr thei ang em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil mak eng emaw kan bengahte i rawn thlen a ni; chutichuan, hêng thil awmzia hi hriat kan duh e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Atheni khuaa mi zawng zawng chu, an khuaa mikhual awmte pawh, an hman châng apiangin thu thar tawh phawt chu sawiin emaw, a ngaithla talin emaw an awm chawt ṭhîn rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Paula chu Areopagi lai takah chuan a ding a, a sawi a. “Nangni Atheni khuaa mite u, engkimah sakhaw ngaihsak mi tak in ni tih ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka lên paha in chibai bûkate ka en laiin maichâm pakhat, a chunga, ‘Hriat Loh Pathian Tân’ tia ziak ka hmu a ni. Chutichuan, hre lova chibai in bûk ṭhina kha, chu mia thu chu ka hrilh che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian, khawvêl leh a chhûnga thil zawng zawng siamtu chu, lei leh vân Lal a nih avângin kuta sak inahte a awm lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />thil tlachham angin mihring kuta rawngbâwlsakin a awm hek lo, amah ngei chu engkim hnêna nunna te, thâwkna te leh thil zawng zawng petu a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, lei chung zawng zawnga awm tûrin bul hmun khat vekin hnam tin a siam a, an tân hun bite a ruat a, an awmna rîte pawh a khamsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian an zawna, an dap an dapa, an hmuh mial theih nân; nimahsela, ani chuan min hlat lo ṭheuh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amah avângin kan nung, kan che, kan awm a ni si a; in hla phuah thiam tute emaw pawhin, ‘Keini pawh a thlahte kan ni si,’ tia an sawi ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathian thlahte kan nih ahnuin, Pathian pangti chu rangkachak te, tangkarua te, lung te, mihring themthiamna leh remruatnaa chher te ang hi emaw tih, kan ring tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathianin kan hriat loh laite a hai der ṭhîn a; nimahsela, tûnah hian ram tina mi zawng zawng sim tûr thu a pe ta a ni, ni a tiam avângin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />chumi nîah chuan a mi ruata chu, leia mite fel takin a ngaihtuahtîr ang; chu chu Pathianin amah chu mitthi zîng ata kaithovin, mi zawng zawng hnênah a hriattîr tawh a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, mitthi zîng ata thawhlehna thu chu an hriat veleh a ṭhenin an nuihsan a; a ṭhenin, “He thu hi i hnênah kan la ngaithla leh ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, Paula chu an zîng ata a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nimahsela, mi tute emaw a hnênah an tel ta tlat a, an ring ta a; chûng zînga ṭhenkhat chu Areopagi-a mi Dionusia leh hmeichhe pakhat, a hming Damari leh an hnêna mi dangte nên chuan an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng thil hnuah chuan Paula chu Atheni khua ata chu a chhuak a, Korinth khuaah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a hming Akuila, Juda pakhat a hmu a, chu mi chu Ponto rama piang a ni a, Klaudian Juda zawng zawng Rom khua ata chhuah thu a pêk avângin, a nupui Priskilli nên Itali ram ata lo kal hlim an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Paula chu chu mite hnênah chuan a thleng ta a, tin; an hnathawh ang thawk a nih avângin anmahni a hrawn a, an hnênah a thawk ve ṭhîn a; an hnathawh chu puan in siam a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Chawlhni apiangin inkhâwmna inah khûn takin thu a hril ṭhîn a, Juda-te leh Grik-te chu thlêm thlûk a tum ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Sila leh Timothea chu Makedonia ram ata chu an lo chhukin, Paula chu thuhril chauhvin a awm ta a. Isua kha Krista chu a ni tih Juda-te hnênah a hrilhfiah ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, an dodâla an sâwtin, Paulan a puan a thing a, an hnênah, “In thihna mawh chu nangmahnin phur ang che u; kei zawng ka hul a ni e; tûn achinah Jentail-te hnênah ka kal ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chuta ta chu a kal a, a hming Tita Justa, mi pakhat inah a lût a, chu mi chuan Pathian a be ṭhîn a; a in pawh chu inkhâwmna in nêna inzawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Krispa, inkhâwmna in hotu chuan a chhûngte zawng zawng nên Lalpa an ring a; Korinth khuaa mi tam tak pawhin an hria a, an ring ve a, baptisma an chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, zânah Lalpan Paula hnênah chuan mumang angin, “Hlau suh la, ngawi lovin thu sawi zêl rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kei i hnênah ka awm alâwm, tina tûr chein tu mân i chungah kut an thlâk lo vang; he khuaah hian mi tam tak ka nei si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Paula chu chutah chuan, Pathian thu zirtîrin an zîngah kum khat leh thla ruk a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Galliova Akaia rama lal aiawha a awm laiin Juda-ten rual takin Paula an bei a, rorêlna ṭhutphah hmaah an hruai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“He mi hrep hian Dân lo anga Pathian be tûrin mi a thlêm thlu ṭhîn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Paulan a chhân dâwnin, Galliovan Juda-te hnênah chuan, “Juda-te u, hêng hi thil dik lo thu emaw, thil tihsual emaw tal ni sela, mathei lovin ka ngaihsak ang che u a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />nimahsela, thute, hmingte, in dân chung thûte mai a nih chuan nangmahnin rêl zâwk rawh u; kei zawngin chutiang thu chu ngaihtuah ka duh lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, rorêlna ṭhutphah aṭang chuan anni chu a hnawt bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Grik mi zawng zawngin inkhâwmna in hotu Sosthena chu an man a, rorêlna ṭhutphah hmaah chuan an vua a, Galliova chuan chûng an thiltih chu engah mah a ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan Paula chu ni rei tak a la châm reng a; chumi zawh chuan unaute chu ṭawng ṭhain a ṭhen a, chuta ta chu Suria ram lamah lawngin a kal ta a, a hnênah Priskilli leh Akuila chu an kal ve bawk a; Paulan thutiam a neih avângin Kenkriai khuaah a lû a mêt zet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Ephesi khua chu an thleng a, chutah chuan anni chu a hnutchhiah ta a; ani erawh chu inkhâwmna inah a lût a, Juda-te hnênah khûn takin thu a sawi rih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, rei deuh châmah an ngên a; nimahsela, a remti lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Pathianin a phal chuan in hnênah ka lo kal leh ang,” tiin ṭawng ṭhain a ṭhen a, Ephesi khua ata chu lawngin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, lawng ata chu Kaisari khuaah a chhuak a, Jerusalem khuaah a han kal a, kohhranhote chu chibai a bûk a; tin, chumi zawhah chuan Antiokei khuaah a zuk kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan rei ngial a awm hnuin a kal leh a, zirtîrho zawng zawng tinghetin Galatia ram leh Phrugia ram chu a fang chhuak vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Juda pakhat, a hming Apollova, Aleksandria khuaa piang, mi fing tak, Ephesi khuaah chuan a zuk kal a; ani chuan Pathian Lehkha Thute a hre nasa êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chu mi chu Lalpa Kawng thu zir tawh a ni a, rilrua ṭhahnemngai tak a nih avângin Isua chanchin chu ngun takin a hril a, a zirtîr ṭhîn a, Johana baptisma thu chauh a hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmna inah huai takin thu a sawi ṭan ta a. Chutichuan, Priskilli leh Akuila chuan a thusawi an hriatin an inah an hruai a, a hnênah Pathian Kawng thu fel lehzualin an hrilhfiah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Akaia rama kal kai a tum veleh unauten an fuih a, amah an lo lawmna tûrin zirtîrhote hnênah lehkha an ziaksak a; tin, a thlen chuan Pathian khawngaihna avânga ringtute chu nasa takin a pui a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />vântlâng hriatin Juda-te chu nasa takin a tidang a, Pathian Lehkha Thu hmangin Isua kha Krista chu a ni tih a hriattîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuan khawchhak bial a fang chhuak zet a, Apollova Korinth khuaa a awm hlân khân Ephesi khua chu a thleng a, zirtîrho tute emaw a hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “In rin tirh lai khân Thlarau Thianghlim in chang em?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Chang lo, Thlarau Thianghlim a awm tih rêng hriat pawh kan hre lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Eng baptisma-ah nge in chan le?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Johana baptisma-ah,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuan, “Johana kha chuan mi hnênah, ‘Mi rawn zuitu tûr (Isua) chu in la ring tûr a ni,’ tiin simna baptisma-in a baptis ṭhîn a nih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chu thu chu an hriat veleh Lalpa Isua hmingin baptisma an chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Paulan an chungah a kut a nghat a, Thlarau Thianghlim chu an chungah a lo thleng ta a; tichuan, ṭawng hriat lohtein thu an sawi a, Pathian thu pawh an hril ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An za chuan patling sâwm leh pahnih lai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Paula chu inkhâwmna inah a lût ṭhîn a, thla thum lai huai takin thu a sawi a, Pathian ram chungchang thu mi a sawipui a, mi a thlêm thlu ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, a ṭhen an tihmawha, an âwih duh lohva, mipui hmaah Kawng chu an sawi chhiat veleh chuan ani chuan anmahni a kalsan a, zirtîrhote chu a kai hrang a, ni tin Turanna zirtîrna inah mi a hnial ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutiang hlîr chuan kum hnih lai a ti a; chutichuan, Asia rama awm zawng zawng, Juda-te leh Grik-te pawhin Lalpa thu chu an hre ta hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin Paula kutin thilmak namên a tihtîr lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />chutichuan, a taksa ata inhrûkna puante emaw, fênthuahte emaw damlote hnênah an rawn keng a, an nâte a reh ṭhîn a, an kawchhûng ata ramhuaite pawh an chhuak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, thiam zuara vâk vâk Juda tuten emaw, “Paulan a thu a tlângaupui ṭhin Isua hmingin kan vau a che,” tiin, ramhuai paite chungah Lalpa Isua hming an lam vei ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Juda mi, puithiam lal pakhat, Skeva chuan chutiang ti ve ṭhîn fapa pasarih a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, ramhuaiin an hnênah, “Isua ka âwih e, Paula pawh ka hria e, nangni erawh chu tu nge maw in nih le?” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ramhuai pai chuan a rawn zuan a, an za chuan a hneh a, a ngam ta zâwk a; chutichuan, chumi in ata chu saruak leh inhliamin an tlân chhuak ta hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ephesi khuaa awm zawng zawng, Juda-te leh Grik-te hnênah pawh chumi thu chu a thang ta a; tichuan, an zain an hlau va, Lalpa Isua hming chu a lian ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ringhote pawh chu a ṭhen tam tak an lo kal a, an thiltihte thupha an chawi a, an inpuang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dawi hmang tam tak pawhin an lehkhabute an rawn la khâwm a, mi zawng zawng mit hmuhah an hâl ta a; tin, a man an chhût a, chêng sîngnga niin an hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuti kauva nasa chuan Lalpa thu chu a darh a, a hneh ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chûng zawhah chuan Paulan, Makedonia ram leh Akaia ram chu fan chhuah riha, Jerusalem khuaa kal a rilrûk a, “Chuta ka kal zawh chuan Rom khua ka tlawh bawk tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, a rawngbâwltu pahnih, Timothea leh Erasta chu Makedonia ramah a kaltîr zet a, ani erawh chu Asia ramah a awm rih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, chûng lai vêl chuan Kawng avâng chuan buai namênin mi an buai ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi pakhat, a hming Demetria, tangkarua chhera, tangkaruaa Diani lem siamtu chuan, a siam thiamte hnênah inhlawhfâkna tam tak a pe ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />chu mi chuan anni chu a ko khâwm a, an hnathawh ang thawktute nên; tin, an hnênah, “Pute u, he hna hi kan hausakna a ni tih in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hetah Ephesi khua chauhvah hian ni lovin, Asia ram khawvêl zawng zawng thawah pawh he Paula hian, ‘Kuta siam pathiante hi Pathian an ni lo,’ tiin mi tam tak a thlêm thlu a, a pakaitîr zo tawh a ni tih nangni ngei pawhin in hmuin in hre bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />chutichuan, kan hnathawh a lân ang tih a hlauhawm chauh hi a ni lo va, pathiannu ropui tak Diani biak in pawh hi an rawn ngai tlâwm ang a, Asia rama mi zawng zawng leh khawvêla miin an biak ṭhin hi, a ropui tehlul nên, a tlâwm ang tih a hlauhawm bawk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu an hriat veleh an thinur ta êm êm a, “Ephesi khuaa mi Diani hi ropui tak a ni!” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, a khuain an buai ta vek a, Gaia leh Aristarka, Makedonia rama mi, Paula hnungzuitute chu an man a, a rualin ennawm inah an tlânpui chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Paulan mipui zînga luh a tum chuan zirtîrhoten an phal lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Asia ram hotu berte zînga ṭhenkhat chu Paula ṭhiante an ni a, a hnênah mi an tîr a, ennawm inah chuan lût lui lo tûrin an thlêm chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, awm khâwmhote chu an buai a, mi tam zâwkin an inkhâwm chhan pawh an hre lo va; chuvângin, ṭhenkhat thu pakhatin an au va, ṭhenkhat thu dangin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, mipui zînga ṭhenkhatin Aleksandra chu an thiamna thu sawi dân tûr chu an hrilh a, Juda-ten ani chu mi hma lamah an nam phei a. Tin, Aleksandra chuan a kutin a zâp a, mi zawng zawng hnênah chuan an thiamna thu sawi a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chu Juda mi a ni tih an hriat veleh, dârkâr hnih lai rual takin, “Ephesi khuaa mi Diani hi ropui tak a ni!” ti hlîrin an au an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, khaw lehkhaziaktuin mipui chu a uidaih zawh chuan, “Ephesi khuaa mite u, Diani ropui tak biak in leh vân aṭanga milem tla kha, Ephesi khuaa mite hi a vêngtu in ni tih tu nge hre lo awm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutichuan, hêng thu hi hnial rual a nih loh ahnu, in ngawi reng tûr a ni, thu dâwn lovin eng mah in ti tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hêng mi, heta in rawn hruaite hi biak in suamhmangte an ni lo va, kan pathiannu sawichhetu lah an ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutichuan, Demetria leh a ṭhian themthiamte pawhin tu lakah pawh thupawi an neih chuan, thupawi sawina inte chu hawn sa a ni alâwm, lal aiawhtute pawh an awm a; inchhâl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Thil dang pawi nei rêng in nih chuan inkhâwm pângngaiah an rem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Vawiina bengchhen avâng hian chhâl hlauhawmin kan awm tâk hi, a bul awm si lovin; chuti chu a ni si a, he inkhâwm chhan hi eng mah kan sawi theih dâwn loh hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu a sawi zawh chuan awmkhâwmhote chu a ṭîntîr ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, bengchheng chu a reh hnuin, Paulan zirtîrhote chu a kohtîr a, a fuih a, ṭawng ṭhain a ṭhen a, Makedonia rama kal tûrin a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, thu tam taka zirtîrhote chu fuih zêlin chumi ram chu a fang chhuak a, Grik ram a thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan thla thum a thang hnuin, Suria ram lamah lawngin a kal dâwn a, Juda-ten amah an phiar avângin Makedonia ramah hâwn tlang a tum leh ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Purrha fapa Sopatera, Beroia khuaa mi te, Thessalonika khuaa mi Aristarka leh Sekunda te, Derbe khuaa mi Gaia te, Timothea te, Asia rama mi Tukika leh Trophima te chu a hnênah Asia ram thlengin an kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûngho chuan kan hma an hruai a, Troas khuaah chuan min lo nghâk reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keini erawh chu, chhang dawidim telh loh ni zawng zawng hnuah chuan, Philippi khua ata chu lawngin kan chhuak a, ni nga chinah Troas khuaah an hnên kan thleng a; chutah chuan ni sarih kan châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ni sarih ni hmasa berah chuan chhang phel tûra kan awm khâwm laiin, Paula chuan a tûka kal a tum avângin an hnênah khûn takin thu a hril a; zanlai thlengin thu a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, pindan chungnung kan awm khâwmnaah chuan khâwnvâr tam tak a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a hming Eutuka, tlangvâl pakhat tukverhah chuan a ṭhu a, a lo muthlu a lo muthlu a. Tin, Paulan thu a sawi rei tâk avângin ani chuan a mutchhuak a tuar ta lo va, in chhâwng thumna aṭang chuan a tla ta a, thiin an chhar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, Paula chu a chhuk a, a chungah a bawh a, a pawm a, “Thlaphâng suh u, a hnuk a la chat lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Paula chu a chho leh a, chhang chu a phel a, chaw a ei a, rei tak, khawvâr thleng hialin an hnênah thukhawchâng a sawi a, chumi hnuah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, râwlthar chu damin an hruai a, thlamuan namênin an thlamuang ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keini erawh chu lawngah kan lo kal tawh a, Asso khaw pan tûrin lawng chuan kan lo chhuak hmasa a, chutah chuan Paula chu lo chuantîr ve kan tum a; ani chuan kea lo kal a tum avângin chutiang chuan aman a ruat rêng a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asso khuaa min rawn fin chuan kan chuantîr ta a, Mitulini khua kan thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chuta ṭang chuan lawngin kan kal leh a, a tûkah chuan Kio thliarkâr zâwn kan thleng a; tin, a tûk lehah Sami thliarkâr kan tlawh a; tin, a tûk lehah chuan Mileti khua kan thleng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuan Asia rama awm rei a duh loh avângin, Ephesi khua chu lawngin pelh a tum sa rêng a ni; a theih chuan Jerusalem khuaah Pentikos ni nan a tum a, a kal hmanhmawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Mileti khua aṭang chuan Ephesi khuaah mi a tîr a, kohhran upahote a hnênah a kohtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a hnên an lo thlen chuan ani chuan an hnênah: “Asia ram ka tlawh tirh ni ata kha in hnêna ka awm chhûng zawng khan, ka awmzia kha in hria e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />thuhnuairawlh ber chung leh, Juda-ten mi phiar avânga mittui tla leh, thil hrehawm ka chunga tlate tuar chunga Lalpa rawng ka bâwl ṭhin kha;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />khati khân a sâwt tûr thu in hnênah eng mah hrilh che u ka tîm lo va, vântlâng zîngah te, in tinah te ka zirtîr ṭhin che u a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Juda-te leh Grik-te hnênah pawh Pathian lama rilru lamlêt thu leh, kan Lalpa Isua Krista lam rin tûr thu ka hriattîr ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, hre rawh u, tûnah hian rilrua kal lo thei lova ka inhriat avângin, Jerusalem khuaah ka kal dâwn hi, chutah chuan ka chunga thil lo thleng tûr chin ka hre lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thlarau Thianghlimin, ‘Phuarna leh hrehawmnain a hmuak a che,’ tiin khaw tinah mi hriattîr ṭhîn, chûng chauh chu ka hria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka tlânsiakna kawng ka hmabâk hlen tûr leh, Pathian khawngaihna Chanchin Ṭha hriattîr tûr, Lalpa Isua hnên aṭanga khami rawngbâwl hna ka hmuh kha thawk zo phawt ila, ka nun pawh thlâkhlelh tlâkah ka ruat lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tin, hre rawh u, nangni zawng zawng, Pathian ram thu tlângaupui zêla ka vah ka vah ṭhinnate hian, ka hmêl in hmu leh tawh lo vang tih ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi zawng zawng thisenah ka hul a ni tih vawiinah hian ka hriattîr a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian rêl zawng zawng a zain in hnênah hrilh ka tîm loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian kohhranho, ama thisena a leite chu châwm tûrin, nangmahni leh in hote zawng zawng chungah chuan fîmkhur rawh u, Thlarau Thianghlimin an chunga hotuah a siam che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka kal hnuin chinghne kawlhte in zîngah an lo lût ang a, pâwlho chu an zuah lo vang tih ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />In zînga mi ngei pawh hi, zirtîrhote in hnêna pakaitîr tûrin, thu hran sawi in lo la awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngaihven rawh u, kum thum meuh, mittui tla chunga a chhûn a zâna mi tin zilh ka bân loh kha hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tûnah hian Pathian leh a khawngaihna thûah ka kawltîr a che u, chu chuan a siam lian thei che u a, mi rilru thianghlimte zîngah ro chan a neihtîr thei bawk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tu ma tangkaruate, rangkachakte, silhfênte ka awh ngai loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hêng kutte hian kei leh ka ṭhiante châkkhai a deh chhuah ṭhin kha, nangni ngeiin in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Engkim ka tih apiangah ka tihhmuh ṭhin che u kha, chutianga thawk rim chung leh, Lalpa Isua thu hre reng chung chuan mi chak lote in ṭanpui tûr a ni; amah ngeiin, ‘Englo lâk aiin pêkin lukhâwng a nei zâwk,’ a tih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu a sawi zawh chuan a ṭhingṭhi a, an zain a ṭawngṭaipui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, an za chuan an ṭap zawih zawih a, Paula chu pawmin an fâwp ngawih ngawih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />a hmêl an hmuh leh tawh loh tûr thu a sawi chu an lungngaihna ber a ni. Tin, lawng thleng chuan amah an thlah ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, anni nên chuan kan inṭhen a, lawngin kan chhuak a, chumi hnuah chuan ngîl takin Kaw thliarkâr kan thleng a; tin, a tûkah Rhodi thliarkâr kan thleng leh a, chuta ṭang chuan kan kal zêl a, Patara khua kan thleng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, Phoiniki rama kai tûr lawng pakhat kan hmu a, kan chuang a, kan kal ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Kupra thliarkâr kan hmu a, vei lam chhawnin kan pêl a. Suria ram lamah kan kal zêl a, Tura khuaah chuan khawmualah kan chhuak ta rih a; chutah chuan lawnga bungrua thiar chhuah tûr a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrhote kan zawng chhuak a, chutah chuan ni sarih kan châm a; tin, anni chuan Thlarau hrilhin, Paula hnênah Jerusalem khua tlawh loh tûr an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng ni zawhah chuan kan chhuak a, kan kal ta a, unaute chuan an zain, an nupui fanaute nên daipâwn thlengin min thlah a; tin, tuifinriat kamah chuan kan ṭhingṭhi a, kan ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, “Dam takin,” kan inti a, lawngah chuan kan chuang a; anni erawh chu an inah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Tura khua ata lawnga kan chhuah hnu chuan Ptolemai khua kan thleng a, unaute chibai kan bûk a, an hnênah ni khat kan châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan kan chhuak a, Kaisari khua kan thleng a; tin, Chanchin Ṭha hriltu Philipa inah kan lût a, ani chu pasarihte zînga pakhat a ni a, a hnênah kan châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu mi chuan fanu pali a nei a, nula thianghlim an ni a, Pathian thu an hril ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan ni tam tak kan châm a, chutih lai chuan Judai ram ata a hming Agaba, zâwlnei pakhat a lo chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kan hnênah a lo kal a, Paula kâwnghrên a la a, a kete, a kutte amahin a inphuar a; tin, “ ‘Jerusalem khuaa Juda-te chuan hetiang hian he kâwnghrên neitu hi an phuar ang a, Jentail-te kutah an pe bawk ang,’ Thlarau Thianghlimin a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu kan hriat veleh keini leh chumi khuaa mite chuan, Paula chu Jerusalem khuaa han kal lo tûrin kan ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Paula chuan a chhâng a, “Eng in ti nge ni in ṭah in ṭaha, ka lung in tihchhiat? Lalpa Isua hming avâng chuan Jerusalem khuaa phuar chang ka huam lo va, thih pawh ka huam asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, thlêm rual a nih loh ahnu chuan, “Lalpa thû thû ni rawh se,” kan ti a, kan bâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan kan bungrua kan siam a, Jerusalem khuaah kan han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaisari khuaa mi zirtîrho tute emaw kan hnênah an kal ve a, anni chuan a hming Mnasona, zirtîr hmasa pâwl, Kupra thliarkâra mi pakhat, kan thlen in pa tûr chu an hruai ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khua kan thlen chuan unauten hlim takin min lo lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Paula hovin Jakoba hnênah kan lût a; chutah chuan kohhran upate zawng zawng pawh an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuan anmahni chibai a bûk zawhin, a rawngbâwlna hmanga Pathianin Jentail-te zînga thil a tihtîr apiang chu a kip a kawiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, unaute chuan chûng thu chu an hriatin Pathian an chawimawi a; tin, Paula hnênah chuan, “Unaupa, Juda-te zînga ringtute tamzia i hmu a; an zain Dân chungah ṭhahnem an ngai bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tin, nangin Jentail-te zînga Juda awmte zawng zawng hnênah chuan, an fate serhtan loh tûr leh, dân anga awm loh tûr, tiin Mosia thlauhthlâkna tûr i zirtîr ṭhîn tih, mi kâ aṭangin i thu hi an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Engtin nge ni ta ang le? I lo thleng tih an hre dâwn ngei si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuvângin, i hnêna kan sawi ang hian ti ang che: Thutiam nei mipa pali kan hnênah an awm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />chûng mite chu hruai la, an hnênah inthian fai ve la, an lû an meh theih nân an tân sum sêng rawh; chutichuan, mi zawng zawngin mi ka aṭanga i thu an hriat apiang kha, tih tak a ni lo tih an hria ang a, nangmah ngei pawh Dân zâwmin fel takin i awm ve zâwk tih an hre dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jentail-te zînga ringtute chungchâng thu zawng, milem biakna thil ei kawngah te, sa thisen ei kawngah te, sa reh hlum ei kawngah te, inngaih kawngah te an inthiarfihlîm tûr a ni, tiin kan rêl a, kan ziak tawh kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan Paulan mipate chu a hruai a, an hnênah a inthian fai ve a, Pathian biak inah chuan a lût a, an tâna sa talh ṭheuh tûr a pêksak hma loh chuan, inthen faina ni an nei rih dâwn tih puithiam hnênah a hrilh lâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, ni sarih chu a tlin dâwn ruaiin, Asia rama Juda-te chuan Paula chu Pathian biak inah chuan an hmu a, mipui zawng zawng an fuihpawrh a, ani chu an man a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />an au va, “Israel mite u, min pui rawh u! He mi hi ram tinah mi zawng zawng hnênah Juda mi te, Dân te, he in te sawichhetu kha a nih hi; chu lo pawh, Pathian biak inah hian Grik mite pawh a luhpui a, he in thianghlim hi a tibawlhhlawh tawh a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />(Chumi hmain khuaah chuan Ephesi khuaa mi Trophima chu a hnênah an hmu a, Paulan chu mi chu Pathian biak inah a luhpui an ring a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, a khuain an phu ta mur mur a, mite chu an tlân khâwm a; Paula chu an man a, Pathian biak in ata chu an hnûk chhuak a; kawngte chu an khâr ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, ani chu tihhlum an tum lai chuan, Jerusalem khuaa mi zawng zawng an buai tih thu chu sipai pâwl hotu lal ber hnên a han thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan sipaite leh sipai za hotute a hruai ta nghal a, an hnênah a tlân chhuk a; tin, anni chuan hotu lal ber leh sipaite chu an hmuh veleh Paula vuak an bâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, hotu lal ber chuan a rawn hnaih a, Paula chu a chelh a, khaidiat pahnih buntîr thu a pe a; tu nge a niha, eng nge a tih a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, mipui zîngah chuan a ṭhen thu khatin an au va, a ṭhen thu dangin an au va; tin, bengchheng avângin a ngaihna a hre thei lo va, kulhbînga hruai luh thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Paulan kailâwn a thlen laiin, mipuiin an beih nasat avângin sipaiten ani chu an chawi kâng zêl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />mi zawng zawngin, “Tiboral rawh u,” tia auvin an zui huai huai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Paula chu kulhbîngah chuan an hruai luh dâwn laiin, ani chuan sipai hotu lal ber hnênah chuan, “I hnênah thu kam khat ka sawi thei ang em?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Grik ṭawng i hria elo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hmâna mite fuihpawrha, mihring phil hmangho sângli thlalêra hruai chhuaktu, Aigupta rama mi kha i ni lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Paula erawh chuan, “Juda mi, Kilikia rama Tarsa khuaa mi ka ni, khaw namêna awm ka ni lo; mi khawngaih la, mi zawng zawng hnênah thu mi hrilhtîr rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, a remtih veleh Paula chu kailâwnah chuan a ding a, mipui ngawih nân a kutin a zâp a; tin, an ngawih ṭhuap veleh Hebrai ṭawngin an hnênah:
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Unaute u, pate u, tûnah in hnênah ka thiamna thu ka hrilh dâwn che u hi ngaithla rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Hebrai ṭawngin an hnênah thu a sawi tih an hriat veleh an ngawi lehzual a; tin, ani chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Juda mi ka ni a, Kilikia rama Tarsa khuaa piang ka ni; nimahsela, he khuaah hian Gamaliela ke bulah chuan zira sei lian ka ni, min thlahtute Dân awmze khermei tak chu zir ṭhîna awm ka ni, vawiina nangmahni zawng zawng ang tak hian Pathian tâna ṭhahnem bawk ṭhîn ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, he Kawnga mite hi tihlum hial khawpin ka tiduhdah ṭhîn a, a hmei a pain ka phuar a, tân inah ka khungtîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Puithiam lalber leh upate zawng zawng pawhin chûng thu chu mi hriatpui thei e, an hnên ata pawh unaute pêk atân lehkha ka hmuh kha; tin, Damaska khuaa awm apiang an hrem atân, phuar chunga Jerusalem khuaa hruai tûrin ka kal kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ka kal a, Damaska khaw kiang kan thlen chuan chawfâk hun laiin, thâwklehkhatan vân ata êng nasa tak ka vêlan a lo êng ta phut a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tin, leiah ka tlu a, ka hnênah, ‘Saula, Saula, nangin engati nge mi tihduhdah hi?’ tiin aw ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, keiin, ‘Lalpa, tu nge i nih?’ tiin ka chhâng a. Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, ‘Nazareth Isua, i tihduhdah hi ka ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ka ṭhiante chuan êng chu an hmu na a, mi betu aw erawh chu an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, keiin, ‘Lalpa, eng nge ka tih ang?’ ka ti a. Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘Tho la, Damaska khuaah lût rawh; thil zawng zawng i tih tûra ruat apiang an hrilh ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chu êng ropui avâng chuan khua ka hmu thei ta lo va, ka ṭhianten kutin mi kai a, Damaska khuaah ka lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat, Anania, Dân kawnga Pathian ngaihsak leh chuta Juda awm zawng zawng hnêna hmingṭha chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ka hnênah a lo kal a, ka kiangah a ding a, ka hnênah, ‘Ka nau Saul, mit vâr nei rawh,’ mi ti a. Tin, chumi lai tak chuan amah ka han hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, ‘Min thlahtute Pathianin a duh zâwng hriaah leh Mi Feltaka chu hmua, a ṭawngkâ hriaah pawh a ruat tawh che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I hmuh leh i hriat thûah khân mi zawng zawng hnênah ama thu hretu i ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, engati nge i la awm reng le? Tho la, ama hming lam chungin baptisma chang la, i sualte tlêng fai ta che,’ mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khuaah hian ka hâwn leh hnuin, Pathian biak ina ka ṭawngṭai laiin englovin mi zêl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tin, ‘Hmanhmawh la, Jerusalem khua ata chhuak rawh; ka chanchin i hril tûr chu an pawm dâwn loh hi,’ a mi tih lai ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, keiin, ‘Lalpa, inkhâwmna in tina a ringtu che apiang tân inah ka khunga, ka vuak ṭhin kha an hre si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tin, i thu hretu Stephana thisen an chhuah lai khân kei pawh a kiangah ka ding a, ka lo remti a, a tihlumtute puante ka vêng hlawm bawk a ni,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, ‘Kal rawh, heta ṭanga hla taka Jentail-te hnênah ka tîr zâwk ang che,’ mi ti ta a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, chu thu thleng chuan an ngaithla a; tin, aw ring takin, “Mi hetiang nek hi khawvêl ata tiboral rawh u; nung tui a ni lo ve,” an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, an au va, an puante an hlîp a, an paih a, vaivut an vânvawrh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />chutichuan, sipai hotu lal ber chuan Paula chu kulhbîng chhûnga hruai luh thu a pe a, a chungah chuti êma an au chhan chu hriat nân vuak chunga chhâl tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, savun hruia an phuar belhbawm zawhin, Paulan a kianga ding sipai za hotu hnênah chuan, “Rom mi rêng rêng in vaw thei em ni, thiam loh chantîr hnu pawh ni si lo lehnghâl?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, sipai za hotu chuan chu chu a hriat veleh, sipai hotu lal ber hnênah chuan a kal a, “I thiltih tûr hi fîmkhur teh khai! He mi hi Rom mi a lo ni e,” a ti a, a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, sipai hotu lal ber chu a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Rom mi i ni maw? Mi hrilh rawh,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, sipai hotu lal ber chuan, “Chumi khaw mi ni tûrin kei zawngin tangka tam tak ka sêng asin,” a ti a, a chhâng a. Tin, Paula chuan, “Kei zawng Rom mi rênga piang ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, nghaisa chunga chhâl tumte chuan ani chu an kalsan ta nghâl a; sipai hotu lal ber pawhin Rom mi a ni tih a hriat chuan a hlau va, a phuar avângin a hlau bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan Juda-ten eng vângin nge Paula an hêk tih hriat fel tumin, sipai hotu lal ber chuan ani chu a phelh a, puithiam lalte leh rorêltu zawng zawngte inkhâwm tûr thu a pe a, Paula chu a hruai chhuak a, an hmaah a dintîr ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuan rorêltute chu a en reng a, “Unaute u, vawiin thlengin Pathian mit hmuha ṭha lama ka hriat apiang tiin ka awm ṭhîn e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalber Anania chuan Paula kianga dingte hnênah a kâa bensak tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuan a hnênah, “Nang, lung pal hnawih vâr pa, Pathianin a bêng zâwk ang che; nang, Dân anga mi ngaihtuah tûrin i ṭhu a, Dân lo anga mi ben tûr i ti vei a ni maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a kianga miten, “Pathian puithiam lalber i hau vei maw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Paulan, “Unaute u, puithiam lalber a ni tih ka hre lo a ni: ‘I chipuite hotu chungah thu ṭha lo sawi suh,’ tih pawh ziak a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Paulan a ṭhen Saddukaite, a ṭhen Pharisaite an ni tih a lo hriatin rorêltute zîngah chuan a au va, “Unaute u, Pharisai ka ni, Pharisai fapa pawh ka ni; mitthi thawhleh beiseina thûah chhuahchhâlhin ka awm a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chu chu a sawi zawh chuan Pharisaite leh Saddukaite chu an inhnial a, rorêltute chu an inkhing ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(Saddukaiten, “Mitthi thawhlehna rêng a awm lo, vântirhkohte, thlaraute pawh a awm hek lo,” an ti ṭhîn; Pharisaite erawh chuan chumi kawng pahnih chu a awm tih an âwih si a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, nasa takin an buai ta a; Pharisaite lama mi lehkhaziaktu ṭhenkhat an ding a, an hnial a, “He mi hi eng mah a sualna kan hre lo ve; thlarau pawhin, vântirhkoh pawhin ani hi bia pawh ni sela, eng nge pawi ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, an inhnial nasat deuh deuh avângin, sipai hotu lal ber chuan Paula chu an pawh sawm a hlau va, sipaite hnênah, zuk kala an zîng ata kulhbînga hruai chho lui tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, a zânah chuan Lalpa chu Paula kiangah a ding a, “Thlamuang takin awm rawh, Jerusalem khuaa ka thu i hriattîr ang bawk hian Rom khuaah pawh i hriattîr tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ni a chhuahin Juda-te an ṭang rual a, Paula an thah hma loh zawng eng mah eia bâr lo tûrin chhia an chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chumi thu phiartute chu sawmli aia tam an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, anni chu puithiam lalte leh upate hnênah an kal a, “Paula kan thah hma loh zawng eng mah tem lo tûrin chhia kan chham ta vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, nangnin, rorêltute nên a thu fel lehzuala ngaihtuah tum angin, in hnêna hruai thla tûrin sipai hotu lal ber hnênah pehhêl deuhvin han sawi rawh u; in kiang hnai a thlen hma pawhin, keini amah that tûrin kan inpeih reng e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, Paula farnua fapain an chân thu chu a lo hria a, kulhbîngah chuan a va lût a, Paula chu a va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuan sipai za hotu pakhat a ko va, “He tlangvâl hi hotu lal ber hnênah chuan hruai rawh; a hnênah thu eng emaw sawi tûr a nei a ni âwm e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, sipai hotu lal ber hnênah chuan a va hruai a, “Paula, mi tâng khân mi ko va, he tlangvâl hi i hnêna rawn hruai tûrin mi tîr a, i hnênah thu eng emaw sawi tûr a nei a ni âwm e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, sipai hotu lal ber chuan a kutah a chelh a, a kal hranpui a, a rûkin, “Eng nge mi hrilh tûr i neih chu?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Paula thu chu fel lehzual deuhva i ngaihtuah tûr angin, naktûkah rorêltute hnêna hruai chhuk tûrin Juda-ten dîl che an remti tlâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, an thu lo âwih suh ang che; an zînga mi sawmli aia tamin an châng reng a, chûng mite chuan amah an thah hma loh chu eng mah eia bâr lo tûrin chhia an chham a; tûnah hian i thu nghâkin inpeih sain an awm reng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, sipai hotu lal ber chuan tlangvâl chu a kaltîr a, “Hêng thu hi mi lo hriattîr tawh tih tu mah hrilh suh ang che,” a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, sipai za hotu pahnih a ko va, “Zân mut reh hunah Kaisari khaw thlenga kal tûrin sipai zahnih nên, sakawr chung chuang mi sawmsarih nên, fei keng mi zahnih nên siam rawh u,” a ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tin, ram awptu Felika hnênah chuan him taka an thlentîr theih nân, Paula an chuantîrna tûrin sate lo siam tûr a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, hetiang hian lehkha a ziak a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Klaudia Lusian Felika, ram awptu ṭha ber chibai a bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“He mi hi Juda-ten an mana, an thah dâwn laiin an hnênah sipaite hruaiin ka kal a, Rom mi a ni tih ka hria a, ka chhan chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, an hêkna chhan hriat ka duh a, an rorêltute hnênah ka hruai chhuk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />chutichuan, an dân thu engahte emaw hêk a ni tih ka hria a; nimahsela, an hêkna thûah thihna leh phuarna khawp meuh tûrin eng mah ka hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Juda-ten amah an châng tih miin min hriattîr veleh i hnênah ani hi ka rawn tîr ta nghâl a ni, a hêktute pawh a chunga thupawi an neih apiang i hmaa sawi tûrin thu ka pe bawk a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, sipaite chuan a thupêk ang chuan Paula chu a zân a zânin an hruai a, Antipatri khua an thlenpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan sakawr chung chuang mite chu a hnêna kal zêl tûrin an kîrsan a, kulhbîngah chuan an kal leh ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />tin, anni chuan Kaisari khua chu an thleng a, ram awptu hnênah lehkha chu an pe a, Paula pawh a hmaah an dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, ram awptu chuan a chhiar zawhin Paula awmna ram a zâwt a. Tin, Kilikia rama mi a ni tih a hriat veleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“A hêktu che pawh chu an lo thlen hunah i thupawi ka ngaihtuah ang,” a ti a. Tin, Heroda inah vên tûr thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ni nga chinah puithiam lalber Anania a lo thleng chhuk a, upa tute emaw nên, a hming Tertulla, thusawi thiam pakhat nên; tin, Paula chunga thupawi chu ram awptu hnênah an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Paula chu an koh chhuah hnu chuan Tertulla chuan amah a hêk ṭan a: “Felik ṭha ber, nangma zârah thlamuang êm êmin kan awm avâng leh, i enkawl avânga he chite tân hian sualte khap ṭhatin a awm ṭhin avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kumkhuain khawiah pawh lungawi takin kan lâwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, i tân ninawm lutuk nih ka duh lo va, i nunnêmnain thu kam khat erawh chu mi ngaihthlâksak tûrin ka ngên a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />He mi hi mi huatthlala tak, khawvêla Juda-teho zawng zawng chawk buaitu leh Nazareth mite pâwla an tupa ber pakhat a nih kan hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian biak in tih bawlhhlawh a tum bawk a; chuvângin, kan man a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />nangmah ngeiin chhuahchhâlin kan hêkna thil zawng zawng hi ama lakah i hre thei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te pawh chuan, “Chûng thu chu chutiang chu a ni,” tiin an ṭanpui ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ram awptu chuan thu sawi tûra Paula chu kuta a zah veleh Paula chuan, “Nang, kum tam tak he chite rorêlsaktu hi i nih ka hriat avângin, lâwm takin ka thiamna thu ka sawi dâwn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaah Pathian be tûrin ka han kal achin chu, ni sâwm leh ni hnih lo liam a la ni lo vang tih i la hre thei ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian biak inah pawh, inkhâwmna inahte pawh, khuaah pawh tu mah ka hnial leh mipui ka fuihpawrh annin min hmu hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tûnah pawh an mi hêkna thu hi i hriatah a bul an chhui chhuak thei hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, he thu hi i hnênah ka inpuang ang, ‘pawl hrang’ an tih Kawng dân angin min thlahtute Pathian ka be ṭhîn. Dân leh Zâwlneite Lehkhabua ziak zawng zawng ringin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tin, mi felte leh fel lote thawhlehna a awm ang tih Pathian lamah ka beisei a, hênghote pawh hian chûng chu an âwih ve bawk si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />chumi avâng chuan Pathian hnên lamah leh mihring hnênah pawh, rilru sual lo mawlh hi vawn ka tum fo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, kum tam tak hnuah hian, Jerusalem-a ka chipuite hnênah thilpêk tûr leh sa talh tûr rawn kengin ka lo kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tin, chûng thil ka pêk lai chuan mipui tel lovin, bengchheng lovin, Pathian biak inah thianghlimin min hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, chutah chuan Asia rama mi Juda tute emaw an awm kha, chûngte chuan ka chungah thu an neih chuan hetah hian i hmaa awmin min hêk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nih loh leh, hêng mite ngei hian rorêltute hmaa ka din lai khân, ka tihsual eng nge an hmuh sawi rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />he thu kam khat avâng hian a nih nghâl loh chuan, an zînga dingin, ‘Mitthi thawhlehna thûah vawiinah hian in hmaah chhuahchhalhin ka awm a nih hi,’ ka tih kha,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Felika chuan Kawng thu chu a lo hre hle tawh a, “Sipai hotu lal ber Lusia chu a lo thlen thlâk hunah in thu ka la rem ang,” tiin thu chu a dah ta rih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Paula chu duat deuhva, a ṭhiante rawngbâwlsak khap lova, vêntîr tûrin sipai za hotu hnênah chuan thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ni eng zât emaw chinah Felika chu a lo kal leh a, a nupui Drusilli, Juda hmeichhia nên, Paula chu a kohtîr a, Krista Isua rinna thu chu a ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuan felna thûte, insûm thûte, rorêlna lo la awm tûr thûte khûn taka a hrilh laiin Felika chuan hlauhawm a ti êm a, “Kal leh ta rih rawh, hun remchâng ka neih hunah ka ko vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Paulan tangka a pêk a beisei bawk a; chuvângin, a ko zing deuh va, a be ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, kum hnih a vei hnu chuan Porkia Festan Felika chu a thlâk ta a; tin, Felika chuan Juda-te zîngah hmingṭhat a duh a, Paula chu phuar sain a hnutchhiah ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Festa chuan ram chu a awp ta a; tin, ni thum chinah Kaisari khua aṭang chuan Jerusalem khuaah a han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalte leh Juda puipate chuan a hnênah Paula chungchâng thu chu a chhe lamin an lo hriattîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaa han hruaitîr tûrin khawngaihna an lo ngên chiam bawk a; kalkawnga lo châna thah an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Festa chuan, “Paula chu Kaisari khuaah an vêng reng a ni, kei pawh rei lo têan ka haw dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, chu mi chuan sualna a neih chuan, in zînga thunei apiangin mi zui thla sela, hêk rawh se,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, an zîngah chuan ni riat emaw, ni sâwm emaw lo liam chu a châm lo va, Kaisari khuaah a haw thla ta a; tin, a tûkah chuan rorêlna ṭhutphahah a ṭhu a, Paula chu rawn hruai tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a lo thlen chuan Jerusalem khuaa mi Juda lo chhukte chu a vêlah an ding a, a chungah thupawi tam tak, rit tak tak an sawi an sawi a, a bul erawh chu an chhui chhuak thei si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuan a thiamna thu a sawi a, “Juda-te dân chungchângah te, Pathian biak in thûah te, Kaisara chungah te pawh thil rêng rêng ka tisual lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, Festa chuan Juda-te zînga hmingṭhat a duh a, Paula hnênah chuan, “Jerusalem khuaa han kala, khitah ka hmaa hêng thu hi rêl i duh em?” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Paula erawh chuan, “Kaisara rorêlna ṭhutphah hmaa ro mi rêlsakna tûrah hian ka din hi; Juda-te chungah thil eng mah ka tisual lo, nang pawhin chu chu i hre chiang hle si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi sual ka niha, thihna khawp meuh thil ti ka nih chuan thih pawh ka hnial lo ve; nimahsela, hêngho min hêkna thil hi a bul eng mah a awm loh chuan, tu mahin an hnênah min pe thei lo vang. Kaisara hnênah ka thlen ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Festa chuan a rorêlpuite a biakrâwn zawhin, “Kaisara hnênah thlen i tum vei a, Kaisara hnênah i kal mawlh ang chu,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ni eng zât emaw chinah chuan, Lal Agrippa leh Berniki chuan Kaisari khua an lo thleng a, Festa chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ni tam tak chutah chuan an châm avângin, Festa chuan Paula thupawi chu lal hnênah chuan a sawi a, “Felika khân mi tâng tu emaw a hnutchhiah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaa ka awm lai khân puithiam lalte leh Juda upaten a chungchâng thu min hrilh a, thiam loh chantîr an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, keiin an hnênah, ‘An hêka leh a hêktute an inhmatawna, an hêkna kawngah a thiamna thu sawi vena remchâng a hmuh hma loh chuan, mi rêng rêng hrem tûra thlah hi Rom khuaa mi dân a ni lo ve,’ tiin ka chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, heta an lo thlenin, rei rial lovin a tûkah chuan rorêlna ṭhutphahah ka ṭhu a, chu mi chu han hruai tûrin thu ka pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a hêktute an din laiin, ka rin ang rêngin a chungah sualna thupawi eng mah rêng an sawi si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />an sakhaw dânte leh Isua, mi pakhat thi tawh, Paula chuan, ‘A nung leh a ni,’ tiin a sawi a, chutih avâng chuan a chungah thubuaite an nei a lo ni zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, keiin chûng thûte chu ngaihtuah ngaihna rêng ka hre lo va, Jerusalem khuaa kala, khita a chûngthu chu rêlsak a duh leh duh loh ka zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, Paula chuan Lalber rêla khêk a ngên ta zâwk a; chuvângin, Kaisara hnêna ka kaltîr theih hma loh chuan vêng tûrin thu ka pe a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Agrippa chuan Festa hnênah chuan, “Kei pawh chu mi thusawi chu ngaihthlâk ka lo duh fo rêng a ni,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Naktûkah a thusawi i ngaithla ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, a tûkah chuan Agrippa leh Berniki chu ropui takin an lo kal a, thusawina inah an lo lût a, sipai hotu liante nên, khuaa mi ṭha deuh deuhte nên; tin, Festa thuin Paula chu an rawn hruai luhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Festa chuan, “Lal Agrippa leh heta kan zînga awm zawng zawngte u, he mi in hmuh hi a ni, a chungchâng thûa Juda-te zawng zawngin an zain nung tawh lo tûr, tia auva Jerusalem khuaah leh heta min biakna kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, thihna khawp meuhvin eng mah a ti lo tih ka hria a; tin, amahin Lalber hnêna thlen a tum avângin tirh ka tum a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />nimahsela, a thu mumal eng mah ka lal hnênah ziak tûr ka hre si lo va. Chuvângin, in hmaah ka rawn hruai chhuah hi, Lal Agripp, nangma hmaa rawn hruai bîk deuh ka ni e, chhuahchhâlh zawha eng emaw tal ziak tûr ka hmuh theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi tâng lalber hnêna tirha, a chunga an hêkna thu hriat teltîr loh chu âtthlâk niin ka hre si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Agrippa chuan Paula hnênah chuan, “I thiamna thu i sawi thei e,” a ti a. Tin, Paula chuan a kut a phar a, a thiamna thu a sawi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Lal Agripp, Juda-ten mi hêkna zawng zawnga ka thiamna thu vawiinah hian i hmaa ka sawi dâwn avâng hian lâwmin ka inhria;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />hei hi ka lâwmna ber a ni, Juda-te zîngah dân leh thubuai zawng zawng kawnga i fin ngawt avângin; chuvângin, muang taka mi ngaihthlâksak tûrin ka ngên a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tîra ka naupan lai ata ka chite zîngah leh Jerusalem khuaa ka awm dân kha, Juda zawng zawngin an hria e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a tîr ata ka chanchin an hria e, khatia kan sakhaw pâwl khermei ber dân pangngaia Pharisaia ka awm kha, an duh chuan mi sawipui thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin min thlahtute hnêna thu a tiam kha beisei kawng thûah, hetah tûnah rorêlsaka ka din hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chu thutiam chu kan hnam sâwm leh hnam hnihin, a chhûn a zâna Pathian rawng ṭhahnemngai taka bâwlin hmuh an beisei ṭhîn. Aw lalpa, chumi beisei thu avâng chuan Juda-ten mi hêk a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathianin mitthite a kai tho tih hi engati nge awihawm loh va in ruat ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei pawhin Nazareth Isua hming kalh lamin thil tam tak ti ila ṭhain ka lo ring ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu ang chu Jerusalem khuaah ka ti bawk ṭhîn a; tin, puithiam lalte hnên aṭangin thu ka hmu a, mi thianghlimte zînga mi tam tak tân inahte ka khung bawk ṭhîn a; an tihhlum laiin tihhlum remti lamah ka ṭang bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmna in tinah ka hrem fo va, Isua thu sâwttîr ka tum hrâm ṭhîn a; tin, an chungah ka kawlh êm êm a, ram dang khaw thleng pawhin ka tiduhdah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutiang ti tûr chuan puithiam lalte thu hmu leh, an tirhna lehkha kengin Damaska khuaah ka kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin e, lalpa, ka kal laiin chawfâk hun a ni a, vân ata êng eng emaw, ni êng aia êng zâwk, keimah leh ka kalpuite vêlah êngin ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, kan zain leiah kan tlu a, Hebrai ṭawngin, ‘Saula, Saula, nangin engati nge mi tihduhdah? Chhunna tiang khen i tân a na e,’ mi tiin aw ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, keiin, ‘Lalpa, tu nge i nih?’ ka ti a. Tin, Lalpa chuan, ‘Isua, i tihduhdah hi ka ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />nimahsela, tho la, ding rawh; hêng i thil hmuhte leh i hnêna ka la inlârna tûr thilte nên, chumi rawngbâwlah leh hretua siam tûr chein i hnênah ka rawn inlâr a nih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />mi zawng zawng leh Jentail-te kut ata ka chhanhim ang che, an mit tivâr tûrin an hnênah ka tirh che hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />chutichuan, thim chu êng lamah an hawisan ang a, Setana thuneihna chu Pathian lamah an hawisan ang, sual ngaihhnathiamna an hmuh nân leh, min rin avânga thianghlim tawhte zînga ro chan an neih nân,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lal Agripp, vâna mi inlâra chu ka hnial lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a tîrin Damaska khuaa mite hnênah, chumi hnuah chuan Jerusalem khuaa mite hnênah te, Judai ram tina mite hnênah te, Jentail-te hnênah te pawh, sim hming pu tlâka thil tia, sima Pathian lam an hawina tûrin ka hril zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chûng avâng chuan a ni Juda-ten Pathian biak inah min mana min tihhlum an tum tâk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian hnên aṭanga ṭanpuina ka hmuh avângin, vawiin thlengin mi tête leh mi liante hnêna thu hriattîrin ka la awm reng a, zâwlneite leh Mosian lo thleng tûr an tih thu chauh lo chu thu dang sawi lovin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />khatia, ‘Kristan hrehawm a tuar ang a; tin, mitthi zîng ata a thawhleh avângin, mi zawng zawng hnênah leh Jentail-te hnênah pawh êng hmuhtîrtu hmasa ber a ni ang,’ an tih thu kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chutianga a thiamna thu a sawi lai chuan Festa chuan aw ring takin, “Paula, i â a ni; i zir tamnain a tiâ che a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, Paula chuan, “Festa ṭha ber, ka â lo asin; thu dik tak leh thu fing tak ka sawi zâwk a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hêng thu hi lal hian a hria alâwm, a hnênah pawh hlau lovin ka sawi hi; hêng thil hi eng mah a hnênah zêp a ni lo tih dik takin ka hria e; hêng hi in kila tih a ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal Agripp, zâwlneite thu i âwih em? I âwih tih ka hria e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Agrippa chuan Paula hnênah, “Rei lo tê chauh thlêma Kristiana mi siam i tum a nih hi!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuan, “Rei sela, rei suh sela, nang chauh ka ti lo, vawiina ka thu hretu zawng zawng pawh hi, keimah anga awm atân Pathian hnênah ka dîl a ni, kawlte hi erawh chu bun ve lovin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, lal nên, ram awptu nên, Berniki nên, an hnêna ṭhute nên chuan an tho hlawm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tin, an kal hrang a, an inbia a, “He mi hian thihna leh kawl bunna khawp meuh thil eng mah a lo tih loh hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Agrippan Festa hnênah, “He mi hian Kaisara hnêna thlen lo tiam tawh suh sela chuan a chhuak mai tûr,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Itali rama lawnga kan kal tûr thu an tihtlûk veleh, Paula leh mi tâng dang tute emaw, Augusta pâwla mi sipai za hotu, a hming Julia an kawltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Adramutteno khaw lawng, Asia ram tuifinriat kama khaw awmte tlawh tûrah chuan kan chuang a, tuifinriatah kan kal ta a; Makedonia rama mi Aristarka, Thessalonika khuaa mi kan hnênah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah Sidon khua kan tlawh a. Tin, Julia chuan Paula a tiṭha hle a, intiharh tûrin a ṭhiante hnênah a lêntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, chuta ṭang chuan tuifinriatah kan kal leh a, thliin a ni lo lamah min nem avângin Kupra thliarkâr phên thli ûp lamah kan kawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Kilikia ram leh Pamphulia ram dep tuifinriat kan pelh hnuin, Lukia rama Mura khua kan thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutah chuan sipai za hotu chuan Aleksandria khaw lawng, Itali ram tlawh tûr chu a hmu a; chumiah chuan min chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ni rei tak zawi zawiin kan kal a, harsa takin Knido khaw zâwn kan thleng hrâm hrâm a, thliin min hnar avângin Salmoni hrûla Kret thliarkâr phên thli ûp lamah kan kawi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tin, harsa takin vaukam kan hrût a, ‘Litengsâwl Mawi’ an tih hmun chu kan thleng ta a; chumi kiangah chuan Lasai khua a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ni tam tak a ral tawh avâng leh lawnga kal a hlauhawm tawh avângin, (Chaw nghei ni chu a lo pêl tawh si a) Paula chuan anni chu a zilh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />an hnênah, “Pute u, lawnga tûna kal hian chhiatna leh boralna nasa tak a thleng dâwn tih ka hria e, a sum leh lawng chungah chauh ka ti lo va, keimahni chungah pawh ka ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, sipai za hotu chuan Paula thusawi ai chuan lawngpu leh lawng neitu thu a âwih zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, thlasik tuar nân litengsâwl chu a rem loh avângin, a tam zâwkin chuta ṭanga tuifinriata kal chhuaha, Phoiniki khua thlen hrâma, chuta thlasik tuar chu an rawtpui a; Phoiniki chu Kret thliarkâra litengsâwl pakhat a ni a, hmârchhak leh chhimchhak chhawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, chhim thli chu zawi zawia a lo tleh veleh chuan, an duh zâwng an hmu em maw an ti a, thîrchakai chu an khai chhuak a, Kret thliarkâr kam chu an hrût an hrût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, rei lo te achinah khawmual lam aṭang chuan thli na tak a lo tleh chhuk ta a, chu thli chu Eurakuilo an ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, lawng chu a rawn nam fuh a, thli lam a hawi theih loh veleh an thlah ta a, min lên min lên ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a hming Kauda, thliarkâr tê tak tê phên thli ûp lamah kan kawi a, harsa takin lawnglêng chu kan hum thei hrâm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tin, an kaih chhuah hnuin chhanna hruite an hmang a, lawng hnuai lamah an la vêt a, an phuar a; tin, puanzârna engkim an titlu a; chuti lo chuan, litengsâwl Surti an tiha len luh an hlau va; chutichuan, min lên min lên ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan tuifâwnin min vawrh nek avâng chuan lawnga bungrua chu tuiah an paih ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a tûk lehah anmahni kut meuhvin lawng bungrua an paih chhuak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ni rei tak, ni pawh, arsi pawh a lang lo va, thlipui namênin min nuai lo va, nun rêng kan beisei tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chaw ei lova rei tak an awm hnuin, an zîngah Paula a ding a, “Pute u, Kret thliarkârah khân phelh lovin, ka thu kha awiha hêng chhiat leh boralna hi thlen lo tûr in ni na a le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, tûnah pawh hian thlamuang taka awm tûrin ka fuih a che u; in zîngah tu mahin nunna in hloh dâwn lo ve, lawng erawh hi chu a bo dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ta ka ni a, a rawng ka bâwl ṭhin Pathian kha, chu mi vântirhkoh pakhat nizân khân ka kiangah a lo ding a, ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Paula, hlau suh, Kaisara hmaah i ding tûr a ni; tin, ngai rawh, lawnga i hnêna kal zawng zawngte pawh hi Pathianin a pe a che,’ mi ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvângin, pute u, thlamuang takin awm rawh u; Pathian ka ring e, mi hrilh ang zêlin a awm dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, thliarkâr engah emaw min lên chhuak tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Adria tuifinriatah thliin lehlam lehlamah min lên min lên a, zan sâwm leh zan li a tlin zân chuan, zanlaiah emaw, lawng mite chuan khawii khawmual emaw thleng dâwnin an inhria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />chutichuan, tui thûk lam an teh a, hlam sawmhnih niin an hria a; tin, rei lo têah an teh leh a, hlam sâwm leh hlam nga niin an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, lawng mei lamah thîrchakai pali an thlâk a; chuti lo chuan, lung chhe hmunah min lên chhuak hlauh dah ang e, tih an hlau va; tin, khawvâr hlân an nghâkhlel hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, lawng mite chuan lawng hnâr lamah thîrchakaite thlâk tûr anga tiderin, lawnglêng chu tuifinriatah an thlâk a, lawng chu tlânsan an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Paula chuan sipai za hotu leh sipaite hnênah chuan, “Hêngho hi lawnga an awm reng loh chuan in him thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, sipaite chuan lawnglêng hruite chu an zai chat a, an thlah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, khawvâr dâwn lai chuan Paula chuan mi zawng zawng chu chaw eiah a tîr a, “Vawiin hi ni sâwm leh ni li a ni tawh, eng mah ei lovin in nghâk a, in nghei reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chuvângin, chaw ei atân ka tîr chiam a che u; in damna tûr a nih hi; in zîngah tu ma samzai pakhat mah a boral lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, chu thu chu a sawi zawhin chhang a la a, mi zawng zawng hmaah Pathian hnênah lâwmthu a sawi ta a; tin, a phel a, a ei ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tichuan, anni pawh thlamuang takin an awm a, chaw an ei ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, lawnga mi chu kan zain zahnih leh sawmsarih leh paruk kan ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, an ei kham chuan buh chu tuifinriatah an paih a, lawng chu an tizâng deuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, nî a chhuah chuan khawmual chu khawii lai nge a nih an hre lo va; nimahsela, khawii litengsâwl emaw ṭiaupho nei an hmu a, chumi chungah chuan, an theih chuan lawng chhuahtîr an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, thîrchakai thlunnate chu an zai chat a, tuifinriatah an hnutchhiah a; chumi rual chuan kar herna phuarnate chu an phelh a, hma lam puanzâr chu thli chhêm tûr ziain an hnûk chho va, ṭiaupho chu an pan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nimahsela, tuizangkhauh pahnih intawhna hmunah kan lût hlauh va, lawng chu lei an suttîr ta a; tichuan, lawng hnâr lam chu a tâng ta tlat a, tihchêt zawh lohvin a awm reng a, a mei lam erawh chu tuifâwn a nasat avângin a keh sawm ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, sipaite chuan mi tângte chu tihhlum an rawt a; chuti lo chuan, tui hleuh kaite an awm ang a, an tlân bo vang tih an hlau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nimahsela, sipai za hotu chuan Paula chhanhim a duh a, an thiltum chu a khap a; tui hleuh thiam apiang tuifinriatah zuang thlaa khawmual lo kai hmasa tûr leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />mi dang chu, a ṭhen thingphêk chungah te, a ṭhen lawng bungraw dang chungah te kai tûrin thu a pe a. Chutiang chuan an zain khawmualah him takin an kai ta vek a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, kan kai zawh chuan thliarkâr hming chu Meliti a ni tih kan lo hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, awze miten khawngaih namênin min khawngaih lo va; ruah a lo sûr avâng leh a vawh avângin mei an chhêm a, kan zain min lo lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuan thing têl khat a fawm a, meiah a tuah a, a sat avângin rûl a lo chhuak a, a kutah a chû a, a bet ta reng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, awze mite chuan rannung a kuta inkhai reng chu an hmuhin, “He mi hi tual that a ni phawt e, tuifinriat aṭangin tlân chhuak mah sela Phubalatua chuan a nun a âwih tawh lo a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan rannung chu meiah a thing thla a, eng mah a ti lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anni erawh chuan a vûn emaw, thâwklehkhata thia a tlûk nghâl emaw an ring a; rei tak an nghâk a, eng mah a ti lo tih an hriat chuan an rilru an lamlêt a, “Pathian a nih hi,” an ti ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chumi hmun kiangah chuan chumi thliarkâra lal ber, a hming Publia ram a awm; chu mi chuan min lo lâwm a, ni thum lâwm takin min thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Publia pa chu khawsik leh santên veiin a lo mu reng a; tin, a hnênah Paula a lût a, a ṭawngṭai a, a chungah a kutte a nghat a, a tidam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu chu a tih zawh chuan chumi thliarkâra mi dang na nei apiang chu an lo kal a, an dam ta hlawm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />chu mite chuan nasa takin min chawimawi a; tin, kan kal dâwn chuan kan châkkhai apiang lawngah an dah hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, thla thum chinah, a hming Phîr, Aleksandria khaw lawng, thlasika thliarkâra awm tawh, chumi lawngah chuan kan kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Surakus khua kan tlawh a, chutah chuan ni thum kan châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan kan kal kual a, Region khua kan thleng a; tin, ni khat chinah chhim thli a lo tleh a, a tûk lehah Puteoli khua kan thleng leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chutah chuan unaute kan hmu a, an hnêna ni sarih châman min ngên a; chutiang chuan Rom khaw lamah kan kal ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, unauten kan chanchin an hriat veleh, chuta ṭang chuan Appia Dâwr leh Khual bûk Pathum chinah min hmuak tûrin an lo kal a; Paulan chu mite chu a hmuh chuan Pathian hnênah lâwmthu a sawi a, a muang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Rom khuaa kan luh chuan Paula chu a vêngtu sipai hnênah amah chauhva awm an phal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ni thum chinah Paula chuan Juda-te hotu deuh apiang a ko khâwm a; tin, an rawn inkhâwmin an hnênah, “Unaute u, mi zawng zawng leh min thlahtute dân chunga eng mah ka tih loh pawhin, Jerusalem khua aṭangin Rom mite hnênah min tântîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan min chhuahchhâlh zawhin, thihna khawp meuh ka chungah eng mah a awm loh avângin thlah min tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda-ten chu chu an hnial avângin Kaisara hnêna thlen lo thei ka ni ta lo va; nimahsela, ka chite hêkna neia ti ka ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng kawngah chuan nangni hi hmuhah leh biak atân ka ko che u a ni; Israel-te beisei ka ṭâwmpui avânga he khaidiat hi bun ka ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “I chanchin Judai ram ata lehkhatein kan hmu lo va, unaute tu mahin heta lo kalin i chungah thupawi eng mah an puang hek lo, sawi pawh an sawi hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, he pâwl hi ram tinah sawi chhiat an ni si a, nangin engtin nge i ngaih hriat kan duh e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ni an tiam a, chumi nîah chuan a thlen inah a hnênah mi tam tak an lo kal a; zîng aṭanga tlai lam thlengin an hnênah chu thu chu a hrilhfiah a, Pathian ram thu a hriattîr a, Mosia Dân Lehkha thu leh Zâwlneite Lehkhabu thuin Isua lamah anmahni a thlêm a thlêm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhenin a thu sawi chu an ring a, a ṭhenin an ring lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, an inngeih ta lo va, Paulan thu kam khat a sawi zawhin an kal chhuak ta a. A thusawi chu hei hi a ni: “Thlarau Thianghlimin zâwlnei Isaia kâ-an in thlahtute hnêna a sawi kha a dik ngawt mai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘He chite hnênah hian va sawi rawh: Beng zawngin in hre na ang a, a ngaihna erawh chu in hre tawp lo vang; Hmuh zawng in hmu na ang a, hriat erawh chu in hre tawp lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He chite thinlung hi a lo chawlawl ta a, An bengte a lo ngawng deuh va, An maimitchhîng bawk a, Chuti lo chuan, kan mitin kan hmu ang a, Kan bengin kan hria ang a, Kan thinlungin kan hre bawk ang a, Kan hawi kîr leh ang a, Anin min tidam hlauh dah ang e,’ an ti a, a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathian chhandamna thu hi Jentail-te hnêna thawn a ni tih hre rawh u, anni zawngin ngaih pawh an ngaithla ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Paula chu kum hnih pumhlûm a in luah hawhah a awm a, a hnêna lût apiang a lâwm ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian ram thu a hrilh a, Lal Isua Krista thu pawh huai takin a zirtîr ṭhîn a, tu mahin amah an khap si lo va.
  </para>
</usx>
